  'Aback': {
    'id': 8,
    'definition': '<b>ABACK</b>, <i>adv.</i> [At, on or towards the back. See <a href="dict://Back]">Back]</a><br><br>Towards the back; on the back part; backward. In seamen\'s language it signifies the situation of the sails, when pressed back against the mast by the wind.<br><br>Taken aback, is when the sails are carried back suddenly by the wind.<br><br>Laid aback, is when the sails are purposely placed in that situation to give the ship sternway.',
