  'Abactor': {
    'id': 10,
    'definition': '<b>ABAC\'TOR</b>, <i>n.</i> [Latin from abigo, ab and ago, to drive.]<br><br>In law, one that feloniously drives away or steals a herd or numbers of cattle at once, in distinction from one that steals a sheep or two.',
