  'All-Fours': {
    'id': 1698,
    'definition': '<b>ALL-FOURS</b>, <i>n.</i> [all and four.]<br><br>A game at cards, played by two or four persons; so called from the possession of the four honors, by one person, who is then said to have all fours.<br><br>To go on all fours is to move or walk on four legs, or on the two legs and two arms.',
