  'Baldpated': {
    'id': 4655,
    'definition': '<b>BALD\'PATED</b>, <i>a.</i> Destitute of hair; shorn of hair.',
  },
  'Baldrick': {
    'id': 4656,
    'definition': '<b>BALD\'RICK</b>, <i>n.</i> [L.balleus, a belt, and rick, rich. See <a href="dict://these">these</a> words.]<br><br>1. A girdle, or richly ornamented belt; a war girdle.<br><br>A radiant baldrick o\'er his shoulders tied.<br><br>2. The zodiac.',
  },
  'Bale': {
    'id': 4657,
    'definition': '<b>BALE</b>, <i>n.[Heb.</i> to bind, to pledge, and its derivative.]<br><br>1. A bundle or package of goods in a cloth cover, and corded for carriage or transportation.<br><br>2. Formerly, a pair of dice<br><br><b>BALE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To make up in a bale.<br><br><b>BALE</b>, <i>n.</i> [Heb. to grieve or mourn, to be desolate, or to destroy.]<br><br>Misery; calamity.',
