  'Baleful': {
    'id': 4659,
    'definition': '<b>BA\'LEFUL</b>, <i>a.[See</i> Bale.] Woeful; sad; sorrowful; full of grief; producing misery; as, a baleful smart; baleful eyes.<br><br>2. Mischievous; destructive; pernicious; calamitous; deadly; as, baleful enemies; baleful war.',
