  'Bedlam': {
    'id': 5268,
    'definition': '<b>BED\'LAM</b>, <i>n.</i> [Corrupted from Bethlehem, the name of a religious house in London, afterward converted into a hospital for lunatics.]<br><br>1. A mad house; a place appropriated for lunatics.]<br><br>2. A madman; a lunatic; one who lives in Bedlam.<br><br>3. A place of uproar.<br><br><b>BED\'LAM</b>, <i>a.</i> Belonging to a mad house; fit for a mad house.',
