  'Bewray': {
    'id': 5838,
    'definition': '<b>BEWRA\'Y</b>, <i>v.t.</i> beray. To disclose perfidiously; to betray; to show or make visible.<br><br>Thy speech bewrayeth thee. Mat 23.<br><br>[This word is nearly antiquated.]',
