  'Blue-Bottle': {
    'id': 6381,
    'definition': '<b>BLU\'E-BOTTLE</b>, <i>an.</i> [blue and bottle.] A plant, a species of Centaurea, called Cyanus, which grows among corn. This and the former plant receive their names from their blue funnel-shaped flowers.<br><br>1. A fly with a large blue belly.',
