  'Bluff': {
    'id': 6391,
    'definition': '<b>BLUFF</b>, <i>a.</i> [Eng.leap, from shooting forward.]surly; blustering.<br><br><b>BLUFF</b>, <i>n.</i> A high bank, almost perpendicular, projecting into the sea; a high bank presenting a steep front.<br><br><b>BLUFF\'-BOWED</b>, <i>a.</i> [bluff and bow.] Having broad and flat bows.<br><br><b>BLUFF\'-HEADED</b>, <i>a.</i> [bluff and head.] Having an upright stem.',
