  'Bluntness': {
    'id': 6405,
    'definition': '<b>BLUNT\'NESS</b>, <i>n.</i> Want of edge or point; dullness; obtuseness; want of sharpness.<br><br>1. Coarseness of address; roughness of manners, rude sincerity or plainness.',
