  'Bluster': {
    'id': 6416,
    'definition': '<b>BLUS\'TER</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [Probably allied to blaze, blast.]<br><br>1. To be loud, noisy or swaggering; to bully; to purr; to swagger; as a turbulent or boasting person.<br><br>2. To roar, and be tumultuous, as wind; to be boisterous; to be windy;; to hurry.<br><br><b>BLUS\'TER</b>, <i>n.</i> Noise; tumult; boasting; boisterousness; turbulence; roar of a tempest; violent wind; hurry; any irregular noise and tumult from wind, or from vanity.',
