  'Bolt-Rope': {
    'id': 6525,
    'definition': '<b>BOLT-ROPE</b>, <i>n.</i> [bolt and rope.] A rope to which the edges of sails are sewed to strengthen them. That part of it on the perpendicular side is called the leech-rope; that at the bottom, the foot-rope; that at the top, the head-rope.',
