  'Bolus': {
    'id': 6535,
    'definition': '<b>BO\'LUS</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. bolus; Gr. a mass.] A soft mass of any thing medicinal to be swallowed at once, like a pill. It may be of any ingredients, made a little thicker than honey.',
