  'Bout': {
    'id': 6777,
    'definition': '<b>BOUT</b>, <i>n.</i> A turn; as much of an action as is performed at one time; a single part of an action carried on at successive intervals; essay; attempt.<br><br><b>BOUT</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. bibo.] We use this word tautologically in the phrase, a drinking-bout; or the word is the same as the preceding.',
