  'Bowels': {
    'id': 6797,
    'definition': '<b>BOW\'ELS</b>, <i>n.</i> plu.<br><br>1. The intestines of an animal; the entrails, especially of man. The heart. 2.Cor.6.12.<br><br>2. The interior part of any thing; as the bowels of the earth.<br><br>3. The seat of pity or kindness; hence, tenderness, compassion, a scriptural sense.<br><br>Bowel, in the singular, is sometimes used for gut.',
