    'definition': '<b>BOY\'AU</b>, <i>n.</i> boy\'o. In fortification, a ditch covered with a parapet, serving as a communication between two trenches.<br><br><b>BOY\'-BLIND</b>, <i>a.</i> Blind as a boy; undiscerning.',
