  'Bracer': {
    'id': 6844,
    'definition': '<b>BRA\'CER</b>, <i>n.</i> That which braces, binds or makes firm; a band or bandage; also, armor for the arm.<br><br>1. An astringent medicine, which gives tension or tone to any part of the body.',
