    'definition': '<b>BRACK\'EN</b>, <i>n.</i> Fern. [See <a href="dict://Brake">Brake</a>.]',
  },
  'Bracket': {
    'id': 6853,
    'definition': '<b>BRACK\'ET</b>, <i>[Heb.</i> to bend the knee; hence it signifies the knee.]<br><br>1. Among workers in timber, an angular wooden stay, in form of the knee bent, to support shelves, scaffolds and the like.<br><br>2. The cheek of a mortar carriage, made of strong plank.<br><br>3. In printing, hooks; thus, [].',
