  'Branchiostegous': {
    'id': 6911,
    'definition': '<b>BRANCHIOS\'TEGOUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [Gr. gills, and a covering.]<br><br>Having gill-covers, or covered gills, as a branchiostegous fish; covering the gills, as the branchiostegous membrane. The branchiostegi are an order of fish in the Linnean system, the rays of whose fins are bony,but whose gill-covers are destitute of bony rays.',
