    'definition': '<b>BRAWL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [L. proelior.]<br><br>1. To quarrel noisily and indecently.<br><br>2. To speak loud and indecently.<br><br>3. To roar as water; to make a noise.<br><br><b>BRAWL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To drive or beat away.<br><br><b>BRAWL</b>, <i>n.</i> Noise; quarrel; scurrility; uproar.<br><br>1. Formerly, a kind of dance.',
