  'Bray': {
    'id': 6966,
    'definition': '<b>BRAY</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To pound, beat or grind small; as, to bray a fool in a mortar. Prov 27.<br><br>2. To make a harsh sound, as of an ass.<br><br>3. To make a harsh,disagreeable grating sound.<br><br><b>BRAY</b>, <i>n.</i> The harsh sound or roar of an ass; a harsh grating sound.<br><br>1. Shelving ground.<br><br><b>BRAY</b>, <i>n.</i> A bank or mound of earth.',
