  'Breakfast': {
    'id': 6989,
    'definition': '<b>BREAK\'FAST</b>, <i>n.</i> brek\'fast. [break and fast.]<br><br>1. The first meal in the day; or the thing eaten at the first meal.<br><br>2. A meal, or food in general.<br><br><b>BREAK\'FAST</b>, <i>v.i.</i> brek\'fast. To eat the first meal in the day.<br><br><b>BREAKFAST</b>, <i>v.t.</i> brekfast. To furnish with the first meal in the morning.',
