  'Breastplate': {
    'id': 7007,
    'definition': '<b>BREAST\'PLATE</b>, <i>n.</i> [breast and plate.]<br><br>1. Armor for the breast.<br><br>2. A strap that runs across a horse\'s breast.<br><br>3. In Jewish antiquity, a part of the vestment of the high priest, consisting of a folded piece of the rich embroidered stuff of which the ephod was made. It was set with twelve precious stones, on which were engraved the names of the twelve tribes.',
