  'Breathing': {
    'id': 7016,
    'definition': '<b>BRE\'ATHING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Respiring; living; uttering.<br><br>1. Exhibiting to the life; as breathing paint.<br><br><b>BRE\'ATHING</b>, <i>n.</i> Respiration; the act of inhaling and exhaling air.<br><br>1. Aspiration; secret prayer.<br><br>2. Breathing-place; vent.<br><br>3. Accent; aspiration.<br><br><b>BRE\'ATHING</b>-<b>PLACE</b>, <i>n.</i> A pause.<br><br>1. A vent.',
