  'Cabiai': {
    'id': 7664,
    'definition': '<b>CABIAI</b>, <i>n.</i> An animal of South America resembling a hog, living on the margins of lakes and rivers, and feeding on fish. It is a species of Cavy, called also thick-nosed tapir.',
