  'Cachalot': {
    'id': 7687,
    'definition': '<b>CACHALOT</b>, <i>n.</i> A cetaceous fish, the physeter or spermaceti whale. The principal species are, the black headed with a dorsal fin, and the round-headed with a dorsal fin, and the round-headed, with out a fin on the back, and with a fistula in the snout. From this whale is obtained the spermaceti.',
