  'Caricature': {
    'id': 8253,
    'definition': '<b>CARICATURE</b>, <i>n.</i> A figure or description in which beauties are concealed and blemishes exaggerated, but still bearing a resemblance to the object.<br><br><b>CARICATURE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To make or draw a caricature; to represent as more ugly than the life.',
