  'Castrate': {
    'id': 8464,
    'definition': '<b>CASTRATE</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To geld; to deprive of the testicles; to emasculate.<br><br>2. To take away or retrench, as the obscene parts of a writing.<br><br>3. To take out a leaf or sheet from a book, and render it imperfect.',
