  'Castration': {
    'id': 8467,
    'definition': '<b>CASTRATION</b>, <i>n.</i> The act of gelding; the act or practice of making eunuchs; the act of taking away the obscene parts of a writing; the act of taking out a leaf or sheet of a book. In botany, the cutting off of the anthers, or tops of the stamens of flowers, before the ripening of the pollen.',
