  'Chaldaic': {
    'id': 8922,
    'definition': '<b>CHALDAIC</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to Chaldea, anciently a country on the Frat or Euphrates, in Asia, called in scripture Shinar. Of this Babylon was the principal city.<br><br><b>CHALDAIC</b>, <i>n.</i> The language or dialect of the Chaldeans.',
