  'Chanter': {
    'id': 9007,
    'definition': '<b>CHANTER</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. One who chants; a singer or songster.<br><br>2. The chief singer, or priest of the chantry.<br><br>3. The pipe which sounds the tenor or treble in a bagpipe.',
