    'definition': '<b>CHARIOT</b>,n.<br><br>1. A half coach; a carriage with four wheels and one seat behind, used for convenience and pleasure.<br><br>2. A car or vehicle used formerly in war, drawn by two or more horses, and conveying two men each. These vehicles were sometimes armed with hooks or sythes.<br><br><b>CHARIOT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To convey in a chariot.',
