  'Charlatanry': {
    'id': 9076,
    'definition': '<b>CHARLATANRY</b>, <i>n.</i> Undue pretensions to skill; quackery; wheedling; deception by fair words.<br>Charless-wain	<b>CHARLESS-WAIN</b>, <i>n.</i> In astronomy, seven stars in the constellation called Ursa Major, or the Great Bear.',
