  'Chartulary': {
    'id': 9101,
    'definition': '<b>CHARTULARY</b>, <i>n.</i> An officer in the ancient Latin church, who had the care of charters and other papers of a public nature. Blackstone uses this word for a record or register, as of a monastery.',
