    'definition': '<b>CHEERLY</b>, <i>a.</i> Gay; cheerful; not gloomy.<br><br><b>CHEERLY</b>, <i>adv.</i> Cheerfully; heartily; briskly.<br><br><b>CHEERLY</b>, <i>a.</i> Gay; sprightly; having power to make gay.<br><br>Come, let us hie, and quaff a cheery bowl.',
