    'definition': '<b>CHEVALIER</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A knight; a gallant young man.<br><br>2. In heraldry, a horseman armed at all points.<br><br><b>CHEVEN</b>, <i>n.</i> A river fish, the chub.',
