  'Chevisance': {
    'id': 9248,
    'definition': '<b>CHEVISANCE</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Achievement; deed; performance; enterprize accomplished.<br><br>2. In law, a making of contracts; a bargain.<br><br>3. An unlawful agreement or contract. James 17.<br><br>4. An agreement or composition, as an end or order set down between a creditor and his debtor.',
