  'Chopping': {
    'id': 9446,
    'definition': '<b>CHOPPING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Cutting; mincing; buying; bartering.<br><br><b>CHOPPING</b>, <i>a.</i> Stout; lusty; plump.<br><br><b>CHOPPING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A high-heeled shoe, worn by ladies in Italy. [See <a href="dict://Chioppine">Chioppine</a>.]<br><br>2. A cutting; a mincing; from chop.',
