  'Circumduction': {
    'id': 9684,
    'definition': '<b>CIRCUMDUCTION</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A leading about.<br><br>2. An annulling; cancellation.<br><br><b>CIRCUMDUCTION</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A leading about.<br><br>2. An annulling; cancellation.',
