  'Circumvolution': {
    'id': 9746,
    'definition': '<b>CIRCUMVOLUTION</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of rolling round; the state of being rolled; also the thing rolled round another.<br><br>2. In architecture, the torus of the spiral line of the Ionic order.',
  },
  'Circumvolve': {
    'id': 9747,
    'definition': '<b>CIRCUMVOLVE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To roll round; to cause to revolve; to put into a circular motion.<br><br><b>CIRCUMVOLVE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To roll round; to revolve.',
