  'Clear-Starching': {
    'id': 9940,
    'definition': '<b>CLEAR-STARCHING</b>, <i>ppr.<br><br></i> 1. Stiffening and clearing with starch.<br><br>2. n. The act of stiffening and clearing with starch.',
