  'Clipping': {
    'id': 10033,
    'definition': '<b>CLIPPING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Cutting off or shortening with shears or scissors; diminishing coin by paring off the edges; curtailing.<br><br><b>CLIPPING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of cutting off, curtailing or diminishing.<br><br>2. That which is clipped off; a piece separated by clipping.',
