  'Closet': {
    'id': 10086,
    'definition': '<b>CLOSET</b>, <i>n.</i> s as z.<br><br>1. A small room or apartment for retirement; any room for privacy.<br><br>When thou prayest, inter into thy closet. Mat 6.<br><br>2. An apartment for curiosities or valuable things.<br><br>3. A small close apartment or recess in the side of a room for repositing utensils and furniture.<br><br><b>CLOSET</b>, <i>v.t.</i> s as z. To shut up in a closet; to conceal; to take into a private apartment for consultation.',
  },
