  'Co-Ordination': {
    'id': 10202,
    'definition': '<b>CO-ORDINATION</b>, <i>n.</i> The state of holding equal rank, or of standing in the same relation to something higher.<br><br>In the high court of Parliament there is a rare coordination of power.',
