  'Coadunate': {
    'id': 10236,
    'definition': '<b>COADUNATE</b>, <i>a.</i> In botany, coadunate leaves are several united at the base. The word is used also to denote one of the natural orders of plants in Lines system.',
  },
  'Coadunition': {
