  'Colossus': {
    'id': 10644,
    'definition': '<b>COLOSSUS</b>, <i>n.</i> A statue of a gigantic size. The most remarkable colossus of antiquity was one at Rhodes, a statue of Apollo, so high that it is said ships might sail between its legs.',
