  'Colts-Tooth': {
    'id': 10651,
    'definition': '<b>COLTS-TOOTH</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A imperfect or superfluous tooth in young horses.<br><br>2. A love of youthful pleasure.<br><br>Well said, Lord Sands;<br><br>Your colts-tooth is not yet cast? Shak.',
