  'Coluber': {
    'id': 10652,
    'definition': '<b>COLUBER</b>, <i>n.</i> In zoology, a genus of serpents, distinguished by scuta or hard crusts on the belly, and scales on the tail. Under this genus are ranked many species, as the viper, black snake, &c.',
