  'Comforter': {
    'id': 10718,
    'definition': '<b>COMFORTER</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. One who administers comfort or consolation; one who strengthens and supports the mind in distress or danger.<br><br>I looked for comforters, but found none. Psa 69.<br><br>Miserable comforters are ye all. Job 16.<br><br>2. The title of the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in my name--he shall teach you all things. John 14.',
