  'Comical': {
    'id': 10724,
    'definition': '<b>COMICAL</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Relating to comedy; comic.<br><br>2. Exciting mirth; diverting; sportive; droll.<br><br>We say, a buffoon is a comical fellow, or his story or his manners are comica.',
