  'Commandry': {
    'id': 10741,
    'definition': '<b>COMMANDRY</b>, <i>n.</i> A kind of benefice or fixed revenue, belonging to a military order, conferred on knights of merit. There are strict and regular commandries, obtained by merit, or in order; and others are of grace and favor, bestowed by the Grand Master. There are also commandries for the religious, in the orders of St. Bernard and St. Anthony.',
