  'Commingle': {
    'id': 10790,
    'definition': '<b>COMMINGLE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To mix together; to mingle in one mass, or intimately; to blend. [See <a href="dict://Mingle">Mingle</a>.]<br><br><b>COMMINGLE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To mix or unite together, as different substances.',
