  'Compendious': {
    'id': 10941,
    'definition': '<b>COMPENDIOUS</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Short; summary; abridged; comprehensive; containing the substance or general principles of a subject or work in a narrow compas; as a compendious system of chimistry; a compendious grammar.<br><br>2. Short; direct; near; not circuitous; as a compendious way to acquire science.',
