  'Complot': {
    'id': 11027,
    'definition': '<b>COMPLOT</b>, <i>n.</i> A plotting together; a joint plot; a plot; a confederacy in some evil design; a conspiracy.<br><br>I know their complot is to have my life.<br><br><b>COMPLOT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To plot together; to conspire; to form a plot; to join in a secret design, generally criminal.<br><br>We find them complotting together, and contriving a new scene of miseries to the Trojans.',
