  'Comply': {
    'id': 11032,
    'definition': '<b>COMPLY</b> , v.i.<br><br>1. To comply with, to fulfil; to perfect or carry into effect; to complete; to perform or execute; as, to comply with a promise, with an award, with a command, with an order. So to comply with ones expectations or wishes, is to fulfil them, or complete them.<br><br>2. To yield to; to be obsequious; to accord; to suit; followed by with; as, to comply with a mans humor.<br><br>The truth of things will not comply with or conceits.',
