    'definition': '<b>COMPROMISSORIAL</b>, <i>a.</i> Relating to a compromise.',
  },
  'Compromit': {
    'id': 11095,
    'definition': '<b>COMPROMIT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L., To promise.] To pledge or engage, by some act or declaration, which may not be a direct promise, but which renders necessary some future act. Hence, to put to hazard, by some previous act or measure, which cannot be recalled; as, to compromit the honor or the safety of a nation.',
