  'Confectioner': {
    'id': 11382,
    'definition': '<b>CONFECTIONARY, CONFECTIONER</b>, <i>n.</i> One whose occupation is to make, or to sell sweetmeats, &c. [The latter word is most generally used.]<br><br><b>CONFECTIONARY</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A place for sweetmeats; a place where sweetmeats and similar things are made of sold.<br><br>2. Sweetmeats in general; things prepared or sold by a confectioner.',
