  'Counterview': {
    'id': 12748,
    'definition': '<b>COUNTERVIEW</b>, <i>n.</i> [counter and view.]<br><br>1. An opposite or opposing view; opposition; a posture in which two persons front each other.<br><br>2. Contrast; a position in which two dissimilar things illustrate each other by opposition.',
