  'Couranto': {
    'id': 12772,
    'definition': '<b>COURANT, COURANTO</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A piece of music in triple time; also, a kind of dance, consisting of a time, a step, a balance and a coupee.<br><br>2. The title of a newspaper.',
