  'Crabbed': {
    'id': 12901,
    'definition': '<b>CRABBED</b>, <i>a.</i> [from crab.]<br><br>1. Rough; harsh; austere; sour; peevish; morose; cynical; applied to the temper.<br><br>2. Rough; harsh; applied to things.<br><br>3. Difficult; perplexing; as a crabbed author or subject.',
