  'Crackling': {
    'id': 12913,
    'definition': '<b>CRACKLING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Making slight cracks, or abrupt noises.<br><br><b>CRACKLING</b>, <i>n.</i> The making of small abrupt cracks or reports, frequently repeated.<br><br>The crackling of thorns under a pot. Eccl 7.',
