  'Cross-Grained': {
    'id': 13222,
    'definition': '<b>CROSS-GRAINED</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Having the grain or fibers across or irregular; as in timber, where a branch shoots from the trunk, there is a curling of the grain.<br><br>2. Perverse; untractable; not condescending.',
