  'Cross-Purpose': {
    'id': 13226,
    'definition': '<b>CROSS-PURPOSE</b>, <i>n.</i> A contrary purpose; contradictory system; also, a conversation in which one person does or pretends to misunderstand anothers meaning. An enigma; a riddle.',
