    'definition': '<b>CROSSING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Drawing; running or passing a line over; erasing; canceling; thwarting; opposing; counteracting; passing over.<br><br><b>CROSSING</b>, <i>n.</i> A thwarting; impediment; vexation.',
