  'Cuckingstool': {
    'id': 13406,
    'definition': '<b>CUCKINGSTOOL</b>, <i>n.</i> An engine for punishing scolds and refractory women; also brewers and bakers; called also a tumbrel and a trebuchet. The culprit was seated on the stool and thus immersed in water.',
  },
  'Cuckold': {
    'id': 13407,
    'definition': '<b>CUCKOLD</b>, <i>n.</i> A man whose wife is false to his bed; the husband of an adulteress.<br><br><b>CUCKOLD</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To make a man a cuckold by criminal conversation with his wife; applied to the seducer.<br><br>2. To make a husband a cuckold by criminal conversation with another man; applied to the wife.',
  },
  'Cuckold-Maker': {
    'id': 13408,
    'definition': '<b>CUCKOLD-MAKER</b>, <i>n.</i> One who has criminal conversation with another mans wife; one who makes a cuckold.',
