  'Cuckoo-Spit': {
    'id': 13415,
    'definition': '<b>CUCKOO-SPIT</b>, <i><b>CUCKOO-SPITTLE</b>,</i> n. A dew or exudation found on plants, especially about the joints of lavender and rosemary. Or a froth or spume found on the leaves of certain plants, as on white field-lychnis or catch-fly, called sometimes spatling poppy.',
