  'Cuth': {
    'id': 13643,
    'definition': '<b>CUTH</b>, <i>in</i> Saxon, signifies known, or famous. Hence, Cuthwin, a famous conqueror; Cuthred, a famous or knowing counselor; Cuthbert, known bright, or famous for skill.',
