  'Cystic': {
    'id': 13704,
    'definition': '<b>CYSTIC</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to a cyst, or contained in a cyst. The cystic duct is the membranous canal that conveys the bile from the hepatic duct into the gall bladder. The cystic artery is a branch of the hepatic.<br><br>Cystic oxyd, a name given to a peculiar substance, supposed to be generated in the bladder or rather in the kidneys.',
