    'definition': '<b><b>DAUB\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Plastering; painting coarsely; disguising clumsily; decking ostentatiously; flattering grossly.<br><br><b>DAUB\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> Plastering; coarse painting; gross flattery.',
