  'Daughter': {
    'id': 13891,
    'definition': '<b><b>DAUGHTER</b>, <i>n,<br><br></i> 1. The female offspring of a man or woman; a female child of any age.<br><br>2. A daughter in law; a son\'s wife. Ruth 3.<br><br>3. A woman; plu. female inhabitants.<br><br>Dinah went out to see the daughters of the land.<br><br>Gen 34.<br><br>4. A female descendant; lineage of females. Luke I.<br><br>5. The female penitent of a confessor.<br><br>This word is used in scripture for the inhabitants of a city or country, male and female. Is. xvi.2. Mat 21. Also as a term of affection or kindness.<br><br>Daughter, be of good comfort. Mat 9.',
  },
