  'Davit': {
    'id': 13902,
    'definition': '<b><b>DAV\'IT</b>, <i>n.</i> A beam used on board of ships, as a crane to hoist the flukes of the anchor to the top of the bow, without injuring the sides of the ship; an operation called fishing the anchor.',
