  'Dearly': {
    'id': 13973,
    'definition': '<b><b>DE\'ARLY</b>, <i>adv.</i><br><br>1. At a high price; as, he pays dearly for his rashness.<br><br>2. With great fondness; as, we love our children dearly; dearly beloved.',
