  'Dearness': {
    'id': 13975,
    'definition': '<b><b>DE\'ARNESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Scarcity; high price, or a higher price than the customary one; as the dearness of corn.<br><br>2. Fondness; nearness to the heart or affections; great value in estimation; preciousness; tender love; as the dearness of friendship.',
