  'Dearth': {
    'id': 13977,
    'definition': '<b><b>DEARTH</b>, <i>n.</i> derth.<br><br>1. Scarcity; as a dearth of corn.<br><br>2. Want; need; famine;<br><br>3. Barrenness; sterility; as a dearth of plot.',
