  'Deathlike': {
    'id': 13986,
    'definition': '<b><b>DEATH\'LIKE</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Resembling death; gloomy; still; calm; quiet; peaceful; motionless; like death in horror or in stillness; as deathlike slumbers.<br><br>2. Resembling death; cadaverous.',
