  'Debacle': {
    'id': 13991,
    'definition': '<b><b>DEBAC\'LE</b>, <i>n.</i> A breaking or bursting forth.<br><br>The geological deluge, which is supposed to have swept the surface of the earth, and to have conveyed the fragments of rocks, and the remains of animals and vegetables, to a distance from their native localities.',
