  'Debar': {
    'id': 13992,
    'definition': '<b><b>DEB\'AR</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To cut off from entrance; to preclude; to hinder from approach, entry or enjoyment; to shut out or exclude; as, we are not debarred from any rational enjoyment; religion debars us from no real pleasure.',
