  'Decagram': {
    'id': 14047,
    'definition': '<b><b>DEC\'AGRAM</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr., ten and a weight.] A French weight of ten grams, or 154 grains, 44 decimals, equal to 6 penny weights, and 10 grains, 44 decimals, equal to 5 grams, 63 decimals, avoirdupoise.',
