  'Decretory': {
    'id': 14234,
    'definition': '<b>DECRETORY</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Judicial; definitive; established by a decree.<br><br>The decretory rigors of a condemning sentence.<br><br>2. Critical; determining; in which there is some definitive event; as, critical or decretory days.',
