  'Deflux': {
    'id': 14412,
    'definition': '<b>DEFLUX</b>, <i>n.</i> A flowing down; a running downward; as a deflux of humors.',
  },
  'Defluxion': {
    'id': 14413,
    'definition': '<b>DEFLUXION</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. To flow down.]<br><br>1. A flowing, running or falling of humors or fluid matter, from a superior to an inferior part of the body; properly, an inflammation of a part, attended with increased secretion.<br><br>2. A discharge of flowing off of humors; as a defluxion from the nose or head in catarrh.',
