  'Dejection': {
    'id': 14498,
    'definition': '<b>DEJECTION</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A casting down; depression of mind; melancholy; lowness of spirits, occasioned by grief or misfortune.<br><br>2. Weakness; as dejection of appetite.<br><br>3. The act of voiding the excrements; or the matter ejected.',
