  'Depict': {
    'id': 14839,
    'definition': '<b>DEPICT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L. To paint.]<br><br>1. To paint; to portray; to form a likeness in colors; as, to depict a lion on a shield.<br><br>2. To describe; to represent in words; as, the poet depicts the virtues of his hero in glowing language.',
