  'Deplore': {
    'id': 14853,
    'definition': '<b>DEPLORE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L. To howl; to wail.] To lament; to bewail; to mourn; to feel or express deep and poignant grief for. We deplored the death of Washington.',
