  'Designing': {
    'id': 15063,
    'definition': '<b>DESIGNING</b>, <i>ppr.<br><br></i> 1. Forming a design; plnning; delineating the outline; drawing figures on a plane.<br><br>2. A. In an ill sense, artful; insidious; intriguing; contriving schemes of mischief; hence, deceitful. Designing men are always liable to suspicion.<br><br><b>DESIGNING</b>, <i>n.</i> The art of delineating objects.',
