  'Disbranch': {
    'id': 15868,
    'definition': '<b>DISBRANCH</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [dis and branch.]<br><br>1. To cut off or separate, as the branch of a tree. [Little used.]<br><br>2. To deprive of branches. [Little used.]',
