  'Discompose': {
    'id': 15963,
    'definition': '<b>DISCOMPOSE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> discompoze. [dis and compose.]<br><br>1. To unsettle; to disorder; to disturb; applied to things.<br><br>2. To disturb peace and quietness; to agitate; to ruffle; applied to the temper or mind; expressing less agitation than fret and vex, or expressing vexation with decorum.<br><br>3. To displace; to discard. [Not in use.]',
