  'Dispread': {
    'id': 16510,
    'definition': '<b>DISPREAD</b>, <i>v.t.</i> dispred. [dis and spread. See <a href="dict://Spread">Spread</a>.] To spread in different ways; to extend or flow in different directions.<br><br><b>DISPREAD</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To expand or be extended.',
