  'Disseize': {
    'id': 16601,
    'definition': '<b>DISSEIZE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [dis and seize.] In law, to dispossess wrongfully; to deprive of actual seizin or possession; followed by of; as, to disseize a tenant of his freehold.<br><br>A man may suppose himself disseized, when he is not so.',
  },
  'Disseized': {
