  'Disseizin': {
    'id': 16604,
    'definition': '<b>DISSEIZIN</b>, <i>n.</i> The act of disseizing; an unlawful dispossessing of a person of his lands, tenements, or incorporeal hereditaments; a deprivation of actual seizin.',
