  'Dissertation': {
    'id': 16629,
    'definition': '<b>DISSERTATION</b>, <i>n.</i> [L., to discourse; to sow, that is, to throw.]<br><br>1. A discourse, or rather a formal discourse, intended to illustrate a subject.<br><br>2. A written essay, treatise or disquisition; as Plutarchs dissertation on the poets; Newtons dissertations on the prophecies.',
