  'Disserve': {
    'id': 16631,
    'definition': '<b>DISSERVE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> disserv. [dis and serve.] To injure; to hurt; to harm; to do injury or mischief to.<br><br>He took the first opportunity to disserve him.<br><br>Too much zeal often disserves a good cause.',
