  'Dodecander': {
    'id': 16962,
    'definition': '<b>DODECANDER</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr., twelve; a male.] In botany, a plant having twelve stamens; one of the class dodecandria. But this class includes all plants that have any number of stamens from twelve to nineteen inclusive.',
