  'Doggerel': {
    'id': 16994,
    'definition': '<b>DOGGEREL</b>, <i>a.</i> An epithet given to a kind of loose, irregular measure in burlesque poetry, like that of Hudibras; as doggerel verse or rhyme.<br><br><b>DOGGEREL</b>, <i>n.</i> A loose, irregular kind of poetry; used in burlesque.',
