  'Drawing-Room': {
    'id': 17374,
    'definition': '<b>DRAWING-ROOM</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A room appropriated for the reception of company; a room in which distinguished personages hold levees, or private persons receive parties. It is written by Coxe, withdrawing-room, a room to which company withdraws from the dining-room.<br><br>2. The company assembled in a drawing-room.',
