    'definition': '<b>DRAWL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To utter words in a slow lengthened tone.<br><br><b>DRAWL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To speak with slow utterance.<br><br><b>DRAWL</b>, <i>n.</i> A lengthened utterance of the voice.',
