  'Drinking': {
    'id': 17449,
    'definition': '<b>DRINKING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Swallowing liquor; sucking in; absorbing.<br><br><b>DRINKING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of swallowing liquors, or of absorbing.<br><br>2. The practice of drinking to excess. We say, a man is given to drinking.',
