  'Driver': {
    'id': 17462,
    'definition': '<b>DRIVER</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. One who drives; the person or thing that urges or compels any thing else to move.<br><br>2. The person who drives beasts.<br><br>3. The person who drives a carriage; one who conducts a team.<br><br>4. A large sail occasionally set on the mizenyard or gaff, the foot being extended over the stern by a boom.',
