  'Drizzle': {
    'id': 17464,
    'definition': '<b>DRIZZLE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [G., L.] To rain in small drops; to fall as water from the clouds in very fine particles. We say, it drizzles; drizzling drops; drizzling rain; drizzling tears.<br><br><b>DRIZZLE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To shed in small drops or particles.<br><br>The air doth drizzle dew.<br><br>Winters drizzled snow.',
  },
  'Drizzled': {
