  'Drizzling': {
    'id': 17466,
    'definition': '<b>DRIZZLING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Falling in fine drops or particles; shedding in small drops or particles.<br><br><b>DRIZZLING</b>, <i>n.</i> The falling of rain or snow in small drops.',
