  'Droil': {
    'id': 17469,
    'definition': '<b>DROIL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To work sluggishly or slowly; to plod. [Not much used.]<br><br><b>DROIL</b>, <i>n.</i> A mope; a drone; a sluggard; a drudge. [Little used.]',
