  'Droll': {
    'id': 17470,
    'definition': '<b>DROLL</b>, <i>a.</i> [G.] Odd; merry; facetious; comical; as a droll fellow.<br><br><b>DROLL</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. One whose occupation or practice is to raise mirth by odd tricks; a jester; a buffoon.<br><br>2. A farce; something exhibited to raise mirth or sport.<br><br><b>DROLL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To jest; to play the buffoon.<br><br><b>DROLL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To cheat.',
