  'Enroll': {
    'id': 18954,
    'definition': '<b>ENROLL</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> 1. To write in a roll or register; to insert a name or enter in a list or catalogue; as, men are enrolled for service.<br><br>2. To record; to insert in records; to leave in writing.<br><br>3. To wrap; to involve.',
