  'Ensconce': {
    'id': 18969,
    'definition': '<b>ENSCONCE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> enscons\'. [from sconce.]<br><br>To cover, or shelter, as with a sconce or fort; to protect; to secure.<br><br>I will ensconce me behind the arras.',
