    'definition': '<b>EXTRU\'DE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L. extrudo; ex and trudo, to thrust.<br><br>1. To thrust out; to urge, force or press out; to expel; as, to extrude a fetus.<br><br>2. To drive away; to drive off.',
