  'Extuberance': {
    'id': 20517,
    'definition': '<b>EXTU\'BERANCE<br><br>EXTU\'BERANCY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. extuberans, extubero; ev and tuber, a puff.]<br><br>1. In medicine, a swelling or rising of the flesh; a protuberant part.<br><br>2. A knob or swelling part of a body.',
