  'Eyeglass': {
    'id': 20564,
    'definition': '<b>EY\'EGLASS</b>, <i>n.</i> A glass to assist the sight; spectacles.<br><br>In telescopes, the glass next the eye; and where there are several, all except the object glass are called eye-glasses.',
