    'definition': '<b>FA\'INTING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Falling into a swoon; failing; losing strength or courage; becoming feeble or timid.<br><br><b>FA\'INTING</b>, <i>n.</i> A temporary loss of strength, color and respiration; syncope; deliquium; leipothymy; a swoon.',
