  'Faintness': {
    'id': 20679,
    'definition': '<b>FA\'INTNESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The state of being faint; loss of strength, color and respiration.<br><br>2. Feebleness; languor; want of strength.<br><br>3. Inactivity; want of vigor.<br><br>4. Feebleness, as of color or light.<br><br>5. Feebleness of representation; as faintness of description.<br><br>6. Feebleness of mind; timorousness; dejection; irresolution.<br><br>I will send a faintness into their hearts. Lev 26.',
