  'Fallacy': {
    'id': 20719,
    'definition': '<b>FAL\'LACY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. fallacia.]<br><br>1. Deceptive or false appearance; deceitfulness; that which misleads the eye or the mind. Detect the fallacy of the argument.<br><br>2. Deception; mistake. This appearance may be all a fallacy.<br><br>I\'ll entertain the favored fallacy.',
