  'Fallibility': {
    'id': 20723,
    'definition': '<b>FALLIBIL\'ITY</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://Fallible">Fallible</a>.]<br><br>1. Liableness to deceive; the quality of being fallible; uncertainty; possibility of being erroneous, or of leading to mistake; as the fallibility of an argument, of reasoning or of testimony.<br><br>2. Liableness to err or to be deceived in one\'s own judgment; as the fallibility of men.',
