  'Fallible': {
    'id': 20724,
    'definition': '<b>FAL\'LIBLE</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. fallo, to deceive.]<br><br>1. Liable to fail or mistake; that may err or be deceived in judgment. All men are fallible.<br><br>2. Liable to error; that may deceive. Our judgments, our faculties, our opinions are fallible; our hopes are fallible.',
