    'definition': '<b>FAL\'LOWING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Plowing and harrowing land without sowing it.<br><br><b>FAL\'LOWING</b>, <i>n.</i> The operation of plowing and harrowing land without sowing it. Fallowing is found to contribute to the destruction of snails and other vermin.',
