  'Falsehood': {
    'id': 20741,
    'definition': '<b>FALSEHOOD</b>, <i>n.</i> fols\'hood. [false and hood.]<br><br>1. Contrariety or inconformity to fact or truth; as the falsehood of a report.<br><br>2. Want of truth or veracity; a lie; an untrue assertion.<br><br>3. Want of honesty; treachery; deceitfulness; perfidy.<br><br>But falsehood is properly applied to things only. [See <a href="dict://falseness">falseness</a>.]<br><br>4. Counterfeit; false appearance; imposture.',
