  'Filanders': {
    'id': 21418,
    'definition': '<b>FIL\'ANDERS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> A disease in hawks, consisting of filaments of coagulated blood; also, small worms wrapped in a thin skin or net, near the reins of a hawk.',
