  'Filtration': {
    'id': 21459,
    'definition': '<b>FILTRA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> The act or process of filtering; defecation by passing liquors through woolen cloth, brown paper, or other porous substance, as certain kinds of stone, which permit the liquor to pass, but retain the foreign matter.',
