  'Finding': {
    'id': 21478,
    'definition': '<b>FINDING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Discovering.<br><br><b>FINDING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Discovery; the act of discovering.<br><br>2. In law, the return of a jury to a bill; a verdict.',
