    'definition': '<b>FIN\'ICAL</b>, <i>a.</i> [from fine.]<br><br>1. Nice; spruce; foppish; pretending to a great nicety or superfluous elegance; as a finical fellow.<br><br>2. Affectedly nice or showy; as a finical dress.',
