    'definition': '<b>FIN\'ISHER</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. One who finishes; one who completely performs.<br><br>2. One who puts an end to.<br><br>3. One who completes or perfects.<br><br>Jesus, the author and finisher of our faith. Heb 12.',
