    'definition': '<b>FIN\'ISHING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Completing; perfecting; bringing to an end.<br><br><b>FIN\'ISHING or FIN\'ISH</b>, <i>n.</i> Completion; completeness; perfection; last polish.',
