  'Fissile': {
    'id': 21625,
    'definition': '<b>FIS\'SILE</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. fissilis, from fissus, divided, from findo, to split.]<br><br>That may be split, cleft or divided in the direction of the grain, or of natural joints.<br><br>This crystal is a pellucid fissile stone.',
