  'Flay': {
    'id': 21785,
    'definition': '<b>FLAY</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [Gr. whence bark, rind; probably a contracted word.]<br><br>1. To skin; to strip off the skin of an animal; as, to flay an ox.<br><br>2. To take off the skin or surface of any thing. [Not used.]',
