  'Flea': {
    'id': 21789,
    'definition': '<b>FLEA</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://Flee">Flee</a> and Fly.]<br><br>An insect of the genus Pulex. It has two eyes and six feet; the feelers are like threads; the rostrum is inflected, setaceous, and armed with a string. The flea is remarkable for its agility, leaping to a surprising distance, and its bite is very troublesome.',
  },
  'Fleabane': {
