  'Fleabite': {
    'id': 21791,
    'definition': '<b>FLE\'ABITE,<br><br>FLE\'ABITING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The bite of a flea, or the red spot caused by the bite.<br><br>2. A trifling wound or pain, like that of the bite of a flea.',
