  'Foist': {
    'id': 22099,
    'definition': '<b>FOIST</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>To insert surreptitiously, wrongfully, or without warrant.<br><br>Lest negligence or partiality might admit or foist in abuses and corruption.<br><br><b>FOIST</b>, <i>n.</i> A light and fast sailing ship. Obs.',
