  'Footstalk': {
    'id': 22201,
    'definition': '<b>FOOTSTALK</b>, <i>n.</i> [foot and stalk.] In botany, a petiole; a partial stem supporting the leaf, or connecting it with the stem or branch. Sometimes, but rarely, the same footstalk supports both the leaf and fructification, as in Turnera and Hibiscus.',
