    'definition': '<b>FOP</b>, <i>n.</i> [The Latin voppa, a senseless fellow, is evidently from the same root, with the sense of emptiness or lightness.]<br><br>A vain man of weak understanding and much ostentation; one whose ambition is to gain admiration by showy dress and pertness; a gay trifling man; a coxcomb.',
