    'definition': '<b>FOP\'PERY</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Affectation of show or importance; showy folly; as the foppery of dress or of manners.<br><br>2. Folly; impertinence.<br><br>Let not the sound of shallow foppery enter my sober house.<br><br>3. Foolery; vain or idle practice; idle affectation.',
