  'Forceful': {
    'id': 22236,
    'definition': '<b>FORCEFUL</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Impelled by violence; driven with force; acting with power.<br><br>Against the steed he threw his forceful spear.<br><br>2. Violent; impetuous.',
