  'Forebode': {
    'id': 22261,
    'definition': '<b>FOREBO\'DE</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> 1. To foretell; to prognosticate.<br><br>2. To foreknow; to be prescient of; to feel a secret sense of something future; as, my heart forebodes a sad reverse.',
