    'definition': '<b>FOURFOLD</b>, <i>a.</i> Four double; quadruple; four times told; as a fourfold division.<br><br>He shall restore the lamb fourfold. 2 Sam 12.<br><br><b>FOURFOLD</b>, <i>n.</i> Four times as much.',
