  'Fourth': {
    'id': 22616,
    'definition': '<b>FOURTH</b>, <i>a.</i> The ordinal of four; the next after the third.<br><br><b>FOURTH</b>, <i>n.</i> In music, an interval composed of two tones and a semitone. Three full tones compose a triton, or fourth redundant.',
