  'Fox': {
    'id': 22624,
    'definition': '<b>FOX</b>. n.<br><br>1. An animal of the genus Canis, with a straight tail, yellowish or straw-colored hair, and erect ears. This animal burrows in the earth, is remarkable for his cunning, and preys on lambs, geese, hens or other small animals.<br><br>2. A sly, cunning fellow.<br><br>3. In seaman\'s language, a seizing made by twisting several rope-yarns together.<br><br>4. Formerly, a cant expression for a sword.<br><br><b>FOX</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To intoxicate; to stupify. [Not used.]',
  },
  'Foxcase': {
