  'Freechapel': {
    'id': 22727,
    'definition': '<b>FREECHAP\'EL</b>, <i>n.</i> In England, a chapel founded by the king and not subject to the jurisdiction of the ordinary. The kind may also grant license to a subject to found such a chapel.<br><br>Free city, in Germany, an imperial city, not subject to a prince, but governed by its own magistrates.',
