  'Freeness': {
    'id': 22744,
    'definition': '<b>FREE\'NESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The state or quality of being free, unconstrained, unconfined, unincumbered, or unobstructed.<br><br>2. Openness; unreservedness; frankness; ingenuousness; candor; as the freeness of a confession.<br><br>3. Liberality; generosity; as freeness in giving.<br><br>4. Gratuitousness; as the freeness of divine grace.',
