  'Frenzy': {
    'id': 22767,
    'definition': '<b>FREN\'ZY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. phrenitis, Gr. from mind, which is from moving, rushing. See <a href="dict://Frantic">Frantic</a>.]<br><br>Madness; distraction; rage; or any violent agitation of the mind approaching to distraction.<br><br>All else is towering frenzy and distraction.',
