    'definition': '<b>GIRL</b>, <i>n.</i> gerl. [Low L. gerula, a young woman employed in tending children and carrying them about, from gero, to carry; a word probably received from the Romans while in England.]<br><br>1. A female child, or young woman. In familiar language, any young unmarried woman.<br><br>2. Among sportsmen, a roebuck of two years old.',
