    'definition': '<b>GIT\'TERN</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. cithara.] A guitar. [See <a href="dict://Guitar">Guitar</a>.]<br><br><b>GIT\'TERN</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To play on a gittern.',
