  'Glade': {
    'id': 23875,
    'definition': '<b>GLADE</b>, <i>n.</i> An opening or passage made through a wood by lopping off the branches of the trees. Locally, in the U. States, a natural opening or open place in a forest.<br><br>There interspersed in lawns and opening glades.<br><br>1. In New England, an opening in the ice of rivers or lakes, or a place left unfrozen.<br><br><b>GLADE</b>, <i>n.</i> Smooth ice.',
