  'Gladsome': {
    'id': 23887,
    'definition': '<b>GLAD\'SOME</b>, <i>a.</i> Pleased; joyful; cheerful.<br><br>1. Causing joy, pleasure or cheerfulness; having the appearance of gayety; pleasing.<br><br>Of opening heaven they sung, and gladsome day.',
