  'Glandiferous': {
    'id': 23900,
    'definition': '<b>GLANDIF\'EROUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. glandifer; glans,an acorn, and fero, to bear.]<br><br>Bearing acorns or other nuts; producing nuts or mast. The beech and the oak are glandiferous trees.',
