  'Goodly': {
    'id': 24242,
    'definition': '<b>GOOD\'LY</b>, <i>adv.</i> Excellently.<br><br><b>GOOD\'LY</b>, <i>a.</i> Being of a handsome form; beautiful; graceful; as a goodly person; goodly raiment; goodly houses.<br><br>1. Pleasant; agreeable; desirable; as goodly days.<br><br>2. Bulky; swelling; affectedly turgid.',
