    'definition': '<b>GORGO\'NEAN<br><br>GORGO\'NIAN</b>, <i>a.</i> Like a gorgon; pertaining to gorgons.<br><br>Gorgonia nobilis, in natural history, red coral.<br><br><b>GOR\'-HEN</b>, <i>n.</i> The female of the gor-cock.',
  },
  'Goring': {
