  'Grecian': {
    'id': 24552,
    'definition': '<b>GRE\'CIAN</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to Greece.<br><br><b>GRE\'CIAN</b>, <i>n.</i> A native of Greece. Also, a Jew who understood Greek. Acts 6.<br><br>1. One well versed in the Greek language.',
