  'Greenbroom': {
    'id': 24575,
    'definition': '<b>GREE\'NBROOM<br><br>GREE\'NCLOTH</b>, <i>n.</i> A board or court of justice held in the counting house of the British king\'s household, composed of the lord steward and the officers under him. This court has the charge and cognizance of all matters of justice in the king\'s household, with power to correct offenders and keep the peace of the verge, or jurisdiction of the court-royal, which extends every way two hundred yards from the gate of the palace.',
