  'Greenness': {
    'id': 24585,
    'definition': '<b>GREE\'NNESS</b>, <i>n.</i> The quality of being green; viridity; as the greenness of grass or of a meadow.<br><br>1. Immaturity; unripeness; in a literal or figurative sense; as the greenness of fruit; the greenness of youth.<br><br>2. Freshness; vigor.<br><br>3. Newness.',
