  'Grooping': {
    'id': 24697,
    'definition': '<b>GROOP\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Bringing together in a cluster or assemblage.<br><br><b>GROUP\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> The art of composing or combining the objects of a picture or piece of sculpture.',
  },
  'Groove': {
    'id': 24698,
    'definition': '<b>GROOVE</b>, <i>n.</i> groov.<br><br>1. A furrow, channel, or long hollow cut by a tool. Among joiners, a channel in the edge of a molding, style or rail.<br><br>2. Among miners, a shaft or pit sunk into the earth.<br><br><b>GROOVE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To cut a channel with an edged tool; to furrow.',
