    'definition': '<b>GROSS\'ULAR</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to or resembling a gooseberry; as grossular garnet.<br><br><b>GROSS\'ULAR</b>, <i>n.</i> A rare mineral of the garnet kind, so named from its green color.',
  },
  'Grot': {
    'id': 24710,
    'definition': '<b>GROT<br><br>GROTESK\'</b> , a. Wildly formed; whimsical; extravagant; of irregular forms and proportions; ludicrous; antic; resembling the figure found in the subterraneous apartments in the ancient ruins at Rome; applied to pieces of sculpture and painting, and to natural scenery; as grotesque painting; grotesque design.<br><br><b>GROTESQUE<br><br>GROTESK\'</b> , n. Whimsical figures or scenery.',
