  'Ground-Plot': {
    'id': 24715,
    'definition': '<b>GROUND\'-PLOT</b>, <i>n.</i> The ground on which a building is placed.<br><br>1. The ichnography of a building.<br><br><b>GROUND\'-RENT</b>, <i>n.</i> Rent paid for the privilege of building on another man\'s land.<br><br><b>GROUND\'-ROOM</b>, <i>n.</i> A room on the ground; a lower room.',
