  'Groundage': {
    'id': 24717,
    'definition': '<b>GROUND\'AGE</b>, <i>n.</i> A tax paid by a ship for standing in port.<br><br><b>GROUND\'-ANGLING</b>, <i>n.</i> Fishing without a float, with a bullet placed a few inches from the hook.<br><br><b>GROUND\'-ASH</b>, <i>n.</i> A sapling of ash; a young shoot from the stump of an ash.<br><br><b>GROUND\'-BAIT</b>,n. Bait for fish which sinks to the bottom of the water.<br><br><b>GROUND\'-FLOOR</b>, <i>n.</i> The first or lower floor of a house. But the English call the second floor from the ground the first floor.',
