    'definition': '<b>GROUND\'SEL</b>, <i>n.</i> A plant of the genus Senecio, of several species.<br><br><b>GROUND\'SEL<br><br>GROUND\'-SILL</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. sella, that which is set.]<br><br>The timber of a building which lies next to the ground; commonly called a sill.',
