  'Growl': {
    'id': 24735,
    'definition': '<b>GROWL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [Gr. a grunting.] To murmur or snarl, as a dog; to utter an angry, grumbling sound.<br><br><b>GROWL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To express by growling.<br><br><b>GROWL</b>, <i>n.</i> The murmur of a cross dog.',
