    'definition': '<b>HAND\'F`AST</b>, <i>n.</i> Hold; custody; power of confining or keeping.<br><br><b>HAND\'F`AST</b>, <i>a.</i> Fast by contract; firm.<br><br><b>HAND\'F`AST</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To pledge; to betroth; to bind; to join solemnly by the hand.',
