  'Handful': {
    'id': 25164,
    'definition': '<b>HAND\'FUL</b>, <i>n.</i> As much as the hand will grasp or contain.<br><br>1. As much as the arms will embrace.<br><br>2. A palm; four inches.<br><br>3. A small quantity or number. A handful of men.<br><br>4. As much as can be done; full employment.<br><br>In America, the phrase is,he has his hands full.',
