  'Havock': {
    'id': 25436,
    'definition': '<b>HAV\'OCK</b>, <i>n.</i> Waste; devastation; wide and general destruction.<br><br>Ye gods! what havock does ambition make<br><br>Among your works.<br><br>As for Saul, he made havock of the church. Acts 8.<br><br><b>HAV\'OCK</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To waste; to destroy; to lay waste.<br><br>To waste and havock yonder world.',
