  'Haze': {
    'id': 25475,
    'definition': '<b>HAZE</b>, <i>n.</i> [The primary sense of this word is probably to mix, or to turn, stir and make thick.]<br><br>Fog; a watery vapor in the air, or a dry vapor like smoke, which renders the air thick.<br><br><b>HAZE<br><br></b>, <i>v.i.</i> To be foggy. [A local word.]<br><br><b>HAZE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To frighten. [Not used.]',
