  'Heartily': {
    'id': 25601,
    'definition': '<b>HE`ARTILY</b>, <i>adv.</i> [from hearty.] From the heart; with all the heart; with sincerity; really.<br><br>I heartily forgive them.<br><br>1. With zeal; actively; vigorously. He heartily assisted the prince.<br><br>2. Eagerly; freely; largely; as, to eat heartily.',
