    'definition': '<b>HEAVY-LA\'DEN</b>, <i>a.</i> Laden with a heavy burden.<br><br><b>HEAVY SPAR</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://Baryte">Baryte</a>.] A genus of minerals of four species, viz. rhomboidal, prismatic, di-prismatic and axifrangible.',
  },
  'Hebdomad': {
