  'Hebrew': {
    'id': 25675,
    'definition': '<b>HE\'BREW</b>, <i>n.</i> [Heb. Eber, either a proper name, or a name denoting passage, pilgrimage, or coming from beyond the Euphrates.]<br><br>One of the descendants of Eber, or Heber; but particularly, a descendant of Jacob, who was a descendant of Eber; an Israelite; a Jew.<br><br>1. The Hebrew language.<br><br><b>HE\'BREW</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to the Hebrews; as the Hebrew language or rites.',
