  'Hellenistic': {
    'id': 25765,
    'definition': '<b>HELLENIS\'TIC</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to the Hellenists. The Hellenistic language was the Greek spoken or used by the Jews who lived in Egypt and other countries, where the Greek language prevailed.',
