    'definition': '<b>HELMINTHOLOG\'IC<br><br>HELMINTHOLOG\'ICAL</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://Helminthology">Helminthology</a>.] Pertaining to worms or vermes, or to their history.',
