  },
  'Highly': {
    'id': 26140,
    'definition': '<b>HIGHLY</b>, <i>adv.</i> hi\'ly. With elevation in place.<br><br>1. In a great degree.<br><br>We are highly favored.<br><br>Exercise is highly requisite to health.<br><br>2. Proudly; arrogantly; ambitiously.<br><br>3. With elevation of mind or opinion; with great estimation; as, to think highly of one\'s performances.',
  },
