  'Hockherb': {
    'id': 26275,
    'definition': '<b>HOCK\'HERB</b>, <i>n.</i> A plant, the mallows.<br><br><b>HOCK\'LE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To hamstring.<br><br>1. To mow.<br><br><b>HOCUS POCUS</b>, <i>a.</i> A juggler; a juggler\'s trick; a cheat used by conjurers.',
