    'definition': '<b>HOLDER</b>, <i>n.</i> One who holds or grasps in his hand, or embraces with his arms.<br><br>1. A tenant; one who holds land under another.<br><br>2. Something by which a thing is held.<br><br>3. One who owns or possesses; as a holder of stock, or shares in a joint concern.<br><br>4. In ships, one who is employed in the hold.',
