    'definition': '<b>HOLDING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Stopping; confining; restraining; keeping; retaining; adhering; maintaining, &c.<br><br><b>HOLDING</b>, <i>n.</i> A tenure; a farm held of a superior.<br><br>1. The burden or chorus of a song.<br><br>2. Hold; influence; power over.',
