  'Hopefully': {
    'id': 26459,
    'definition': '<b>HO\'PEFULLY</b>, <i>adv.</i> In a manner to raise hope; in a way promising good. He prosecutes his scheme hopefully.<br><br>1. In a manner to produce a favorable opinion respecting some good at the present time. The young man is hopefully pious.<br><br>2. With hope; with ground to expect.',
