    'definition': '<b>HO\'PELESS</b>, <i>a.</i> Destitute of hope; having no expectation of that which is desirable; despairing.<br><br>I am a woman, friendless, hopeless.<br><br>1. Giving no ground of hope or expectation of good; promising nothing desirable; desperate; as a hopeless condition.',
