  'Hore': {
    'id': 26479,
    'definition': '<b>HORE</b>, <i>n.</i> A woman, married or single, who indulges unlawful sexual intercourse; also, a prostitute; a common woman; a harlot; a woman of ill fame. [This word comprehends adultress and fornicatrix, and all lewd women whether paid for prostitution or not.]<br><br><b>HORE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To indulge unlawful sexual commerce, as a male or female; to be habitually lewd.',
