  'Hortation': {
    'id': 26590,
    'definition': '<b>HORTA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. hortatio, from hortor, to exhort.]<br><br>The act of exhorting, or giving advice; exhortation; advice intended to encourage. [But exhortation is generally used.]',
