  'Humect': {
    'id': 26776,
    'definition': '<b>HUMECT\'<br><br>HUMEC\'TATE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L. humecto, from humeo, to be moist.]<br><br>To moisten; to wet; to water. [Little used.]',
