  'Imam': {
    'id': 27316,
    'definition': '<b>IM\'AM<br><br>IM\'AN</b>, <i>n.</i> A minister or priest among the Mohammedans.<br><br>Imbalm, Imbargo, Imbark, Imbase. See <a href="dict://Embalm,">Embalm,</a> Embargo, Embark, Embase.',
