  'Immaterial': {
    'id': 27409,
    'definition': '<b>IMMATE\'RIAL</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Incorporeal; not material; not consisting of matter; as immaterial spirits. The mind or soul is immaterial.<br><br>2. Unimportant; without weight; not material; of no essential consequence.',
