  'Jews-Harp': {
    'id': 30578,
    'definition': '<b>JEWS-HARP</b>, <i>n.</i> [Jew and harp.] An instrument of music shaped like a harp, which, placed between the teeth and by means of a spring struck by the finger, gives a sound which is modulated by the breath into soft melody. It is called also Jews-trump.',
