  'Jews-Stone': {
    'id': 30581,
    'definition': '<b>JEWS-STONE</b>, <i>n.</i> The clavated spine of a very large egg-shaped sea urchin petrified. It is a regular figure, oblong and rounded, about three quarters of an inch in length, and half an inch in diameter. Its color is a pale dusky gray, with a tinge of dusky red.',
