  'Jig': {
    'id': 30586,
    'definition': '<b>JIG</b>, <i>n.</i> A kind of light dance, or a tune or air.<br><br>1. A ballad.<br><br><b>JIG</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To dance a jig.',
  },
  'Jigger': {
    'id': 30587,
    'definition': '<b>JIG\'GER</b>, <i>n.</i> In sea-language, a machine consisting of a rope about five feet long, with a block at one end and a sheave at the other, used to hold on the cable when it is heaved into the ship, by the revolution of the windlass.',
