  'Jocular': {
    'id': 30607,
    'definition': '<b>JOC\'ULAR</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. jocularis, from jocus, a joke.]<br><br>1. Jocose; waggish; merry; given to jesting; used of persons.<br><br>2. Containing jokes; sportive; not serious; as a jocular expression or style.',
