  'Jubilant': {
    'id': 30694,
    'definition': '<b>JU\'BILANT</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. jubilans. See <a href="dict://Jubilee">Jubilee</a>.] Uttering songs of<br><br>triumph; rejoicing; shouting with joy.<br><br>While the bright pomp ascended jubilant.',
