    'definition': '<b>KEE\'PING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Holding; restraining; preserving; guarding; protecting; performing.<br><br><b>KEE\'PING</b>, <i>n.</i> A holding; restraint; custody; guard; preservation.<br><br>1. Feed; fodder. The cattle have good keeping.<br><br>2. In painting, a representation of objects in the manner they appear to the eye at different distance from it.',
  },
  'Keepsake': {
