  'Kell': {
    'id': 30852,
    'definition': '<b>KELL</b>, <i>n.</i> A sort of pottage. [Not used in America.]<br><br><b>KELL</b>, <i>n.</i> The caul or omentum. [See <a href="dict://Caul,">Caul,</a> the usual orthography of the word.]<br><br>1. The chrysalis of the caterpillar.',
