  'Labefaction': {
    'id': 31120,
    'definition': '<b>LABEFAC\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. labefactio, from labefacio, labo, to totter, and facio, to make.]<br><br>A weakening or loosening; a failing; decay; downfall; ruin.',
