  'Lachrymatory': {
    'id': 31163,
    'definition': '<b>LACH\'RYMATORY</b>, <i>n.</i> A vessel found in sepulchers of the ancients, in which it has been supposed the tears of a deceased person\'s friends were collected and preserved with the ashes and urn. It was a small glass or bottle like a phial.',
