    'definition': '<b>LAW\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> Expeditation; the act of cutting off the claws and balls of the fore feet of mastiffs to prevent them from running after deer.',
  },
  'Lawless': {
    'id': 31512,
    'definition': '<b>LAW\'LESS</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not subject to law; unrestrained by law; as a lawless tyrant; lawless men.<br><br>2. Contrary to law; illegal; unauthorized; as a lawless claim.<br><br>He needs no indirect nor lawless course.<br><br>3. Not subject to the ordinary laws of nature; uncontrolled.<br><br>He, meteor-like, flames lawless through the void.',
