    'definition': '<b>LAW\'LESSNESS</b>, <i>n.</i> The quality or state of being unrestrained by law; disorder.<br><br><b>LAW\'-MAKER</b>, <i>n.</i> One who enacts or ordains laws; a legislator; a lawgiver.<br><br>Law-makers should not be law-breakers.<br><br><b>LAW\'-MONGER</b>, <i>n.</i> A low dealer in law; a pettifogger.',
