  'Laxness': {
    'id': 31527,
    'definition': '<b>LAX\'NESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Looseness; softness; flabbiness; as the laxness of flesh or of muscles.<br><br>2. Laxity; the opposite of tension.<br><br>3. Looseness, as of morals or discipline.<br><br>4. Looseness, as of the bowels.<br><br>5. Slackness, as of a cord.',
