  'Learnt': {
    'id': 31588,
    'definition': '<b>LEARNT</b>, <i>lernt.</i> pp. Obtained as knowledge or information.<br><br><b>LEARNED</b>, <i>a.</i> lern\'ed.<br><br>1. Versed in literature and science; as a learned man.<br><br>2. Skillful; well acquainted with arts; knowing; within; as learned in martial arts.<br><br>3. Containing learning; as a learned treatise or publication.<br><br>4. Versed in scholastic, as distinct from other knowledge.<br><br>Men of much reading are greatly learned, but may be little knowing.<br><br>The learned, learned men; men of erudition; literati.',
