  'Lethargy': {
    'id': 31779,
    'definition': '<b>LETH\'ARGY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. lethargia; Gr. oblivion and idle.]<br><br>1. Preternatural sleepiness; morbid drowsiness; continued or profound sleep, from which a person can scarcely be awaked, and if awaked, remains stupid.<br><br>2. Dullness; inaction; inattention.<br><br>Europe lay them under a deep lethargy.<br><br><b>LETH\'ARGY</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To make lethargic or dull.',
