  'Licorice': {
    'id': 31907,
    'definition': '<b>LIC\'ORICE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. glycyrrhiza; Gr. sweet, and root.]<br><br>A plant of the genus Glycyrrhiza. The root of this plant abounds with a sweet balsamic juice, much used in pectoral compositions.',
