  'Lightsome': {
    'id': 31972,
    'definition': '<b>LIGHTSOME</b>, <i>a.</i> li\'tesome.<br><br>1. Luminous; not dark; not obscure.<br><br>White walls make rooms more lightsome than black. [Little used.]<br><br>The lightsome realms of love.<br><br>[In the latter passage, the word is elegant.]<br><br>2. Gay; airy; cheering; exhilarating.<br><br>That lightsome affection of joy.',
  },
  'Lightsomeness': {
