    'definition': '<b>LI\'GHTSOMENESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Luminousness; the quality of being light; opposed to darkness or darksomeness.<br><br>2. Cheerfulness; merriment; levity. [This word is little used.]',
