  'Limp': {
    'id': 32046,
    'definition': '<b>LIMP</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To halt; to walk lamely.<br><br><b>LIMP</b>, <i>n.</i> A halt; act of limping.<br><br><b>LIMP</b>, <i>a.</i> Vapid; weak. [Not used.]',
