  'Linstock': {
    'id': 32094,
    'definition': '<b>LIN\'STOCK</b>, <i>n.</i> [lint and stock.] A pointed staff with a crotch or fork at one end, to hold a lighted match; used in firing cannon. It may be stuck in the ground or in the deck of a ship.',
