  'Loment': {
    'id': 32355,
    'definition': '<b>LO\'MENT</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. lomentum.] An elongated pericarp, which never bursts. It consists, like the legume, of two valves, with the seeds attached to the under suture, but is divided into small cells, each containing a single seed.',
