  'Lomentaceous': {
    'id': 32356,
    'definition': '<b>LOMENTA\'CEOUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. lomentum, bean meal, a color.]<br><br>Furnished with a loment. The lomentaceae are a natural order of plants, many of which furnish beautiful tinctures or dyes, and whose seeds are contained in a loment or legume.',
  },
  'Lomonite': {
