  'Long-Suffering': {
    'id': 32373,
    'definition': '<b>LONG-SUF\'FERING</b>, <i>n.</i> Long endurance; patience of offense.<br><br>Despisest thou the riches of his goodness, and forbearance, and long-suffering? Rom 2.<br><br><b>aLONG\'-TONGUED</b>, <i>a.</i> Rating; babbling.',
