  'Longevity': {
    'id': 32380,
    'definition': '<b>LONGEV\'ITY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. longavitas; longus, long, and avum, age.]<br><br>Length or duration of life; more generally, great length of life.<br><br>The instances of longevity are chiefly among the abstemious.',
