  'Longsuffering': {
    'id': 32399,
    'definition': '<b>LONG\'SUF\'FERING</b>, <i>a.</i> Bearing injuries or provocation for a long time; patient; not easily provoked.<br><br>The Lord God, merciful and gracious, long-suffering and abundant in goodness. Exo 34.',
