  'Loosestrife': {
    'id': 32429,
    'definition': '<b>LOOSESTRIFE</b>, <i>n.</i> loos\'strife. In botany, the name of several species of plants, of the genera Lysimachia, Epilobium, Lythrum, and Gaura.',
