    'definition': '<b>LOPE</b>, <i>pret.</i> of leap. Obs.<br><br><b>LOPE</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://leap">leap</a>.]<br><br>A leap; a long step. [A word in popular use in America.]<br><br><b>LOPE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To leap; to move or run with a long step, as a dog.',
  },
