  'Lorication': {
    'id': 32452,
    'definition': '<b>LORICA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> The act or operation of covering any thing with a plate or crust for defense; as the lorication of a chimical vessel, to enable it to resist the action of fire, and sustain a high degree of heat.',
