    'definition': '<b>LO\'THING</b>, <i>ppr.</i><br><br>1. Feeling disgust at; having extreme aversion to; as lothing food.<br><br>2. Hating; abhorring; as lothing sin.<br><br><b>LO\'THING</b>, <i>n.</i> Extreme disgust; abhorrence. Ezek 14.',
