  'Louse': {
    'id': 32491,
    'definition': '<b>LOUSE</b>, <i>n.</i> lous. plu. lice.<br><br>A small insect of the genus Pediculus. It has six feet, two eyes, with long feelers and a sting in the mouth. It infests the bodies of men and other animals; but different animals are infested with different species.<br><br><b>LOUSE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> louz. To clean from lice.',
