  'Loving': {
    'id': 32533,
    'definition': '<b>LOVING</b>, <i>ppr.<br><br></i> 1. Entertaining a strong affection for; having tender regard for.<br><br>2. a. Fond; affectionate; as a loving friend.<br><br>3. Expressing love or kindness; as loving words.',
