  'Low-Spirited': {
    'id': 32540,
    'definition': '<b>LOW-SPIR\'ITED</b>, <i>a.</i> Not having animation and courage; dejected; depressed; not lively or sprightly. Losses of property often render men low-spirited. Excessive severity breaks the mind, and renders the child or pupil low-spirited.',
  },
