  'Lowland': {
    'id': 32552,
    'definition': '<b>LOWLAND</b>, <i>n.</i> land which is low with respect to the neighboring country; a low or level country. Thus the Belgic states are called Lowlands. The word is sometimes opposed to a mountainous country; as the Lowlands of Scotland. sometimes it denotes a marsh.',
