  'Lowliness': {
    'id': 32554,
    'definition': '<b>LOWLINESS</b>, <i>n.</i> [from lowly.]<br><br>1. Freedom from pride; humility; humbleness of mind.<br><br>Walk - with all lowliness and meekness. Eph 4. Phil 2.<br><br>2. Meanness; want of dignity; abject state. [In this sense little used.]',
