    'definition': '<b>MAL\'ACHITE</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr. mallows, L. malva, soft, so names from its resembling the color of the leaf of mallows.]<br><br>An oxyd of copper, combined with carbonic acid, found in solid masses of a beautiful green color. It consists of layers, in the form of nipples or needles converging towards a common center. It takes a good polish and is often manufactured into toys.',
