  'Maladministration': {
    'id': 32973,
    'definition': '<b>MALADMINISTRA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://Mal">Mal</a> and Administer.] Bad management of public affairs; vicious or defective conduct in administration, or the performance of official duties, particularly of executive and ministerial duties, prescribed by law; as the maladministration of a king, or of any chief magistrate.',
