  'Malice': {
    'id': 33010,
    'definition': '<b>MAL\'ICE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L.malitia, from malus, evil.] Extreme enmity of heart, or malevolence; a disposition to injure others without cause, from mere personal gratification or from a spirit of revenge; unprovoked malignity or spite.<br><br>--Nor set down aught in malice.<br><br><b>MAL\'ICE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To regard with extreme ill will. [Not used.]',
