  'Malicious': {
    'id': 33011,
    'definition': '<b>MALI\'CIOUS</b>, <i>a.</i> Harboring ill will or enmity without provocation; malevolent in the extreme; malignant in heart.<br><br>I grant him bloody,<br><br>Sudden, malicious, smacking of every sin<br><br>That has a name.<br><br>1. Proceeding from extreme hatred or ill will; dictated by malice; as a malicious report.',
