  'Malignity': {
    'id': 33019,
    'definition': '<b>MALIG\'NITY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. malignitas.] Extreme enmity, or evil dispositions of heart towards another; malice without provocation, or malevolence with baseness of heart; deep rooted spite.<br><br>1. Virulence; destructive tendency; as the malignity of an ulcer or disease.<br><br>2. Extreme evilness of nature; as the malignity of fraud.<br><br>3. Extreme sinfulness; enormity or heinousness; as the malignity of sin.',
