  'Mall': {
    'id': 33023,
    'definition': '<b>MALL</b>, <i>n.</i> maul. [L. malleus.]<br><br>1. A large heavy wooden beetle; an instrument for driving any thing with force.<br><br>2. A blow.<br><br><b>MALL</b>, <i>n.</i> mal. A public walk; a level shaded walk.<br><br><b>MALL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> maul. To beat with a mall; to beat with something heavy; to bruise.',
