  'Mandlestone': {
    'id': 33095,
    'definition': '<b>MAN\'DLESTONE</b>, <i>n.</i> Kernel-stone; almond-stone, called also amygdaloid; a name given to stones or rocks which have kernels enveloped in paste.',
