  'Master-Piece': {
    'id': 33445,
    'definition': '<b>M`ASTER-PIECE</b>, <i>n.</i> A capital performance; any thing done or made with superior or extraordinary skill.<br><br>This wondrous master-piece I fain would see.<br><br>1. Chief excellence or talent.<br><br>Dissimulation was his master-piece.',
