    'definition': '<b>MAUD\'LIN</b>, <i>a.</i> [corrupted from Magdelen, who is drawn by painters with eyes swelled and red with weeping.]<br><br>Drunk; fuddled; approaching to intoxication; stupid.<br><br>And the kind maudlin crowd melts in her praise.<br><br><b>MAUD\'LIN</b>, <i>n.</i> A plant of the genus Achillea.',
