  'Maul': {
    'id': 33546,
    'definition': '<b>MAUL</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. malleus. See <a href="dict://Mall">Mall</a>.]<br><br>A heavy wooden hammer; written also mall.<br><br><b>MAUL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To beat and bruise with a heavy stick or cudgel; to wound in a coarse manner.<br><br>Meek modern faith to murder, hack and maul.',
