  'Meliorate': {
    'id': 33755,
    'definition': '<b>ME\'LIORATE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L.melior,better.] To make better; to improve; as, to meliorate fruit by grafting, or soil by cultivation. Civilization has done much, but christianity more, to meliorate the condition of men in society.<br><br>Nature by art we nobly meliorate.<br><br><b>ME\'LIORATE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To grow better.',
