    'definition': '<b>MENISPERM\'IC</b>, <i>a.</i> The menispermic acid is obtained from the seeds of the menispermum cocculus.',
  },
  'Meniver': {
    'id': 33837,
    'definition': '<b>MEN\'IVER</b>, <i>n.</i> A small white animal in Russia, or its fur which is very fine.',
