  'Menology': {
    'id': 33838,
    'definition': '<b>MENOL\'OGY</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr. month, and discourse.]<br><br>1. A register of months.<br><br>2. In the Greek church, martyrology, or a brief calendar of the lives of the saints, for each day in the year, or a simple remembrance of those whose lives are not written.',
