  'Mephitic': {
    'id': 33858,
    'definition': '<b>MEPHIT\'IC</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. mephitis, an ill smell.] Offensive to the smell; foul; poisonous; noxious; pestilential; destructive to life.<br><br>Mephitic acid is carbonic acid.',
