  'Misconceit': {
    'id': 34391,
    'definition': '<b>MISCONCE\'IT<br>MISCONCE\'IVE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> or i. To receive a false notion or opinion of any thing; to misjudge; to have an erroneous understanding of any thing.<br><br>To yield to others just and reasonable causes of those things, which, for want of due consideration heretofore, they have misconceived.',
