  },
  'Misconstruction': {
    'id': 34399,
    'definition': '<b>MISCONSTRUC\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> Wrong interpretation of words or things; a mistaking of the true meaning; as a misconstruction of words or actions.',
  },
  'Misconstrue': {
    'id': 34400,
    'definition': '<b>MISCON\'STRUE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To interpret erroneously either words or things. It is important not to misconstrue the Scriptures.<br><br>Do not, great sir, misconstrue his intent.<br><br>A virtuous emperor was much affected to find his actions misconstrued.',
  },
  'Misconstrued': {
