    'definition': '<b>MISCON\'STRUING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Interpreting wrongly.',
  },
  'Miscorrect': {
    'id': 34404,
    'definition': '<b>MISCORRECT\'</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To correct erroneously; to mistake in attempting to correct another.<br><br>He passed the first seven years of his life at Mantua, not seventeen, as Scaliger miscorrects his author.',
