    'definition': '<b>MISCOUNT\'</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To count erroneously; to mistake in counting.<br><br><b>MISCOUNT\'</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To make a wrong reckoning.<br><br><b>MISCOUNT\'</b>, <i>n.</i> An erroneous counting or numbering.',
