    'definition': '<b>MISDOING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Doing wrong; committing a fault or crime.<br><br><b>MISDOING</b>, <i>n.</i> A wrong done; a fault or crime; an offense.',
  },
  'Misdoubt': {
    'id': 34427,
    'definition': '<b>MISDOUBT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> misdout\'. [See <a href="dict://Doubt">Doubt</a>.] To suspect of deceit or danger. [An ill formed word and not in use.]<br><br><b>MISDOUBT\'</b>, <i>n.</i> Suspicion of crime or danger. [Not used.]<br><br>1. Irresolution; hesitation. [Not used.]',
