    'definition': '<b>MISFOR\'TUNE</b>, <i>n.</i> Ill fortune; ill luck; calamity; an evil or cross accident; as loss of property at sea or by fire.<br><br>Consider why the change was wrought,<br><br>You\'ll find it his misfortune, not his fault.',
  },
