    'definition': '<b>MISGIV\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Filling with doubt or distrust; failing.<br><br><b>MISGIV\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> A failing of confidence; doubt; distrust.<br><br>Doubts, suspicions and misgivings.',
