    'definition': '<b>MISLA\'Y</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To lay in a wrong place.<br><br>The fault is generally mislaid upon nature.<br><br>1. To lay in a place not recollected; to lose.<br><br>If the butler be the tell-tale, mislay a spoon so as he may never find it.',
  },
  'Mislayer': {
    'id': 34496,
    'definition': '<b>MISLA\'YER</b>, <i>n.</i> One that lays in a wrong place; one that loses.',
