    'definition': '<b>MISMAN\'AGE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To manage ill; to administer improperly; as, to mismanage public affairs.<br><br><b>MISMAN\'AGE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To behave ill; to conduct amiss.',
