    'definition': '<b>MIS\'TER</b>, <i>n.</i> The common title of address to gentlemen, and to men of all classes. In writing, it is expressed by the abbreviation Mr.<br><br><b>MIS\'TER</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To occasion loss. [Not in use.]',
  },
