    'id': 34709,
    'definition': '<b>MIX\'ED</b>, <i>pp.</i> United in a promiscuous mass or compound; blended; joined; mingled; associated.<br><br>1. a. Promiscuous; consisting of various kinds or different things; as a mixed multitude.',
  },
