  'Moan': {
    'id': 34725,
    'definition': '<b>MOAN</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To lament; to deplore; to bewail with an audible voice.<br><br>Ye floods, ye woods,ye echoes, moan<br><br>My dear Columbo dead and gone.<br><br><b>MOAN</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To grieve; to make lamentations.<br><br>Unpitied and unheard, where misery moans.<br><br><b>MOAN</b>, <i>n.</i> Lamentation; audible expression of sorrow; grief expressed in words or cried.<br><br>Sullen moans,<br><br>Hollow groans.',
