  'Mobile': {
    'id': 34734,
    'definition': '<b>MO\'BILE</b>, <i>a.</i> Movable. [Not used.]<br><br><b>MO\'BILE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. mobilis.] The mob; the populace.<br><br>Primum mobile, in the ancient astronomy, a ninth heaven or sphere, supposed to be beyond the fixed stars, and to be the first mover of all the lower spheres.',
