  'Mobility': {
    'id': 34735,
    'definition': '<b>MOBIL\'ITY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. mobilitas, from moveo, to move.]<br><br>1. Susceptibility of motion; capacity of being moved.<br><br>2. Aptitude to motion; activity; readiness to move.<br><br>3. In cant language, the populace.<br><br>4. Fickleness; inconstancy.',
