  'Mordication': {
    'id': 35077,
    'definition': '<b>MORDICA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> [from L. mordeo, to bite.] The act of biting or corroding; corrosion.<br><br>Another cause is the mordication of the orifices, especially of the mesentery veins.',
