    'id': 35304,
    'definition': '<b>MUG\'GY</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Moist; damp;; moldy; as muggy straw.<br><br>2. Moist; damp; close; warm and unelastic; as muggy air.<br><br>[This is the principal use of the word in America.]',
