  'Nauseousness': {
    'id': 35719,
    'definition': '<b>NAUSEOUSNESS</b>, <i>n.</i> Lothesomeness; quality of exciting disgust; as the nauseousness of a drug or medicine.<br><br>The nauseousness of such company disgusts a reasonable man.',
