  'Nautic': {
    'id': 35720,
    'definition': '<b>NAUTIC</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. A seaman, a ship, See <a href="dict://Navy]">Navy]</a> Pertaining to seamen or navigation; as nautical skill; a nautical almanack.',
