  'Nucleus': {
    'id': 36437,
    'definition': '<b>NU\'CLEUS</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. a nut.]<br><br>1. Properly, the kernel of a nut; but in usage, any body about which matter is collected.<br><br>2. The body of a comet, called also its head, which appears to be surrounded with light.',
