  'Numerosity': {
    'id': 36473,
    'definition': '<b>NUMEROS\'ITY</b>, <i>n.</i> The state of being numerous. [Not used.]',
  },
  'Numerous': {
    'id': 36474,
    'definition': '<b>NU\'MEROUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L.]<br><br>1. Being many, or consisting of a great number of individuals; as a numerous army; a numerous body; a numerous people.<br><br>2. Consisting of poetic numbers; melodious; musical. In prose, a style becomes numerous by the alternate disposition or intermixture of long and short syllables, or of long and short words; or by a judicious selection and disposition of smooth flowing words, and by closing the periods with important or well sounding words.',
  },
  'Numerously': {
