  'Nun': {
    'id': 36487,
    'definition': '<b>NUN</b>, <i>n.</i> A woman devoted to a religious life, and who lives in a cloister or nunnery, secluded from the world, under a vow of perpetual chastity.<br><br><b>NUN</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A web-footed fowl of the size of a duck, with a white head and neck.<br><br>2. The blue titmouse.',
