  'Officious': {
    'id': 36903,
    'definition': '<b>OFFI\'CIOUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. officiosus.]<br><br>1. Kind; obliging; doing kind offices.<br><br>Yet not to earth are those bright luminaries Officious.<br><br>2. Excessively forward in kindness; importunately interposing services.<br><br>You are too officious in her behalf that scorns your services.<br><br>3. Busy; intermeddling in affairs in which one has no concern.',
