  'Oft': {
    'id': 36913,
    'definition': '<b>OFT</b>, <i>adv.</i> Often; frequently; not rarely. It was formerly used in prose and may be so used still; but is more generally used in poetry.<br><br>Oft she rejects, but never one offends.',
