  'Often': {
    'id': 36914,
    'definition': '<b>OFTEN</b>, <i>adv.</i> of\'n. comp. oftener; superl. oftenset. Frequently; many times; not seldom.<br><br><b>OFTEN</b>, <i>a.</i> of\'n. Frequent. [Improper.]',
