  'Ogee': {
    'id': 36920,
    'definition': '<b>OGEE\'</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. In architecture, a molding consisting of two members, the one concave, the other convex, or of a round and a hollow somewhat like an S.<br><br>2. In gunnery, an ornamental molding in the shape of an S, used on guns, mortars and howitzers.',
