  'Omniscience': {
    'id': 37015,
    'definition': '<b>OMNIS\'CIENCE,<br><br>OMNIS\'CIENCY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. omnis, all, and scientia, knowledge.]<br><br>The quality of knowing all things at once; universal knowledge; knowledge unbounded or infinite. Omniscience is an attribute peculiar to God.',
