  'Omnium': {
    'id': 37018,
    'definition': '<b>OM\'NIUM</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. omnis, all.] The aggregate of certain portions of different stocks in the public funds; a word in use among dealers in the English stocks.<br><br>Omnium denotes all the particulars included in the contract between government and the public for a loan.',
