  'Omphacine': {
    'id': 37021,
    'definition': '<b>OM\'PHACINE</b>, <i>a.</i> [Gr. from unripe fruit.]<br><br>Pertaining to or expressed from unripe fruit. Omphacine oil is a viscous brown juice extracted from green olives. With this the wrestlers in the ancient gymnastic exercises used to anoint their bodies.',
