  'Onerous': {
    'id': 37042,
    'definition': '<b>ON\'EROUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. onerosus, from onus, a load.<br><br>1. Burdensome; oppressive.<br><br>2. In Scots law, being for the advantage of both parties; as an onerous contract; opposed to gratuitous.',
