  'Outgo': {
    'id': 37532,
    'definition': '<b>OUTGO\'</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [See <a href="dict://Go">Go</a>.]<br><br>1. To go beyond; to advance before in going; to go faster.<br><br>2. To surpass; to excel.<br><br>3. To circumvent; to overreach.',
  },
  'Outgoing': {
    'id': 37533,
    'definition': '<b>OUTGO\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Going beyond.<br><br><b>OUT\'GOING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The act of going out.<br><br>2. The state of going out. Psa 65.<br><br>3. Utmost border; extreme limit. Josh 17.',
