  'Overhaul': {
    'id': 37773,
    'definition': '<b>OVERHAUL\'</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To spread over.<br><br>2. To turn over for examination; to separate and inspect.<br><br>3. To draw over.<br><br>4. To examine again.<br><br>5. To gain upon in a chase; to overtake.',
