    'definition': '<b>PAD\'LOCK</b>, <i>n.</i> A lock to be hung on a staple and held by a link.<br><br><b>PAD\'LOCK</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To fasten with a padlock; to stop; to shut; to confine.',
