  'Pandiculation': {
    'id': 38217,
    'definition': '<b>PANDICULA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. pandiculor,to yawn, to stretch.]<br><br>A yawning; a stretching; the tension of the solids that accompanies yawning, or that restlessness and stretching that accompanies the cold fit of an intermittent.',
