  'Pearl-Stone': {
    'id': 38779,
    'definition': '<b>PEARL-STONE</b>, <i>n.</i> A mineral regarded as a volcanic production. It occurs in basaltic and porphyritic rocks, and is classed with pitch stone.<br><br>Pearl-stone is a subspecies of indivisible quartz.',
