    'definition': '<b>PE\'AS-COD<br><br>PEASANT</b>, <i>n.</i> pez\'ant. A countryman; one whose business is rural labor.<br><br><b>PEASANT</b>, <i>a.</i> pez\'ant. Rustic; rural.',
