  'Placenta': {
    'id': 39968,
    'definition': '<b>PLACEN\'TA</b>, <i>n.</i> [L.]<br><br>1. In anatomy, the substance that connects the fetus to the womb, a soft roundish mass or cake by which the circulation is carried on between the parent and the fetus.<br><br>2. The part of a plant or fruit to which the seeds are attached.',
  },
  'Placental': {
