  'Placket': {
    'id': 39976,
    'definition': '<b>PLACK\'ET</b>,n. A petticoat. If this is the sense of the word in Shakespeare, it is a derivative. The word signifies the opening of the garment; but it is nearly or wholly obsolete.',
