  'Plad': {
    'id': 39977,
    'definition': '<b>PLAD</b>, <i>n.</i> A striped or variegated cloth worn by the highlanders in Scotland. It is a narrow woolen stuff worn round the waist or on the shoulders, reaching to the knees, and in cold weather to the feet. It is worn by both sexes.',
