  'Pompous': {
    'id': 40523,
    'definition': '<b>POMP\'OUS</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Displaying pomp; showy with grandeur; splendid; magnificent; as a pompous procession; a pompous triumph.<br><br>2. Ostentatious; boastful; as a pompous account of private adventures.',
