    'definition': '<b>PON\'DEROUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. ponderosus.]<br><br>1. Very heavy; weighty; as a ponderous shield; a ponderous load.<br><br>2. Important; momentous; as a ponderous project. [This application of the word is unusual.]<br><br>3. Forcible; strongly impulsive; as a motion vehement or ponderous; a ponderous blow.<br><br>Ponderous spar, heavy spar, or baryte.',
