  'Pontificate': {
    'id': 40555,
    'definition': '<b>PONTIF\'ICATE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. pontificatus.] The state or dignity of a high priest; particularly, the office or dignity of the pope.<br><br>He turned hermit in the view of being advanced to the pontificate.<br><br>1. The reign of a pope.<br><br>Painting, sculpture and architecture may all recover themselves under the present pontificate.',
