  'Popinjay': {
    'id': 40580,
    'definition': '<b>POP\'INJAY</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A parrot.<br><br>2. A woodpecker, a bird with a gay head.<br><br>The green woodpecker, with a scarlet crown, a native of Europe.<br><br>3. A gay, trifling young man; a fop or coxcomb.',
