  'Poplar': {
    'id': 40583,
    'definition': '<b>POP\'LAR</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. populus.] A tree of the genus Populus, of several species, as the abele, the white poplar,the black poplar, the aspen-tree, &c. It is numbered among the aquatic trees.',
