  'Potting': {
    'id': 40824,
    'definition': '<b>POT\'TING</b>, <i>n.</i> [form pot.] Drinking; tippling.<br><br>1. In the W. Indies,the process of putting sugar in casks for draining.<br><br><b>POT\'TING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Preserving in a pot; draining, as above; drinking.',
