  'Poulterer': {
    'id': 40829,
    'definition': '<b>POULTERER</b>,n.<br><br>1. One who makes it his business to sell fowls for the table.<br><br>2. Formerly, in England, an officer of the king\'s household, who had the charge of the poultry.',
