  'Poultice': {
    'id': 40830,
    'definition': '<b>POULTICE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. puls, pultis.] A cataplasm; a soft composition of meal, bran, or the like substance, to be applied to sores, inflamed parts of the body, &c.<br><br><b>POULTICE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To apply a cataplasm to.',
