  'Poultry': {
    'id': 40832,
    'definition': '<b>POULTRY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. pullus, a chicken, or other young animal; allied to Eng. foal; L. pullulo.] Domestic fowls which are propagated and fed for the table,such as cocks and hens, capons, turkeys, ducks and geese.',
