  'Pout': {
    'id': 40854,
    'definition': '<b>POUT</b>, <i>n.</i> A fish of the genus Gadus, about an inch in length; the whiting pout.<br><br>1. A bird.<br><br>2. A fit of sullenness. [Colloquial.]<br><br><b>POUT</b>, <i>v.i.<br><br></i> 1. To thrust out the lips, as in sullenness, contempt or displeasure; hence, to look sullen.<br><br>2. To shoot out; to be prominent; as pouting lips.',
  },
  'Pouter': {
    'id': 40855,
    'definition': '<b>POU\'TER</b>, <i>n.</i> A variety of the common domestic pigeon, with an inflated breast.',
