  'Pressing': {
    'id': 41371,
    'definition': '<b>PRESS\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Urging with force or weight; squeezing; constraining; crowding; embracing; distressing; forcing into service; rolling in a press.<br><br>1. a. Urgent; distressing.<br><br><b>PRESS\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> The act or operation of applying force to bodies. The pressing of cloth is performed by means of the screw, or by a calendar.',
