  'Prester': {
    'id': 41381,
    'definition': '<b>PRES\'TER</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr. to kindle or inflame.]<br><br>1. A meteor thrown from the clouds with such violence, that by collision it is set on fire.<br><br>2. The external part of the neck, which swells when a person is angry.',
