  'Priming': {
    'id': 41533,
    'definition': '<b>PRI\'MING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Putting powder in the pan of a fire-arm.<br><br>1. Laying on the first color.<br><br><b>PRI\'MING</b>, <i>n.</i> The powder in the pan of a gun, or laid along the channel of a cannon for conveying fire to the charge.<br><br>1. Among painters, the first color laid on canvas or on a building, &c.',
