  'Primrose': {
    'id': 41550,
    'definition': '<b>PRIM\'ROSE</b>, <i>n.</i> s as z. [L. primula veris; primus, first, and rose; literally, the first or an early rose in spring.]<br><br>A plant of the genus Primula, of several varieties, as the white, the red, the yellow flowered, the cowslip, &c. Shakespeare uses the word for gay or flowery; as the primrose way.',
