  },
  'Putrefaction': {
    'id': 42573,
    'definition': '<b>PUTREFAC\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. putrefactio; putris; putrid, and facio,to make.] A natural process by which animal and vegetable bodies are disorganized and dissolved, or reduced to their original separate elements. Putrefaction is greatly accelerated by heat and moisture.',
