  'Puzzle': {
    'id': 42589,
    'definition': '<b>PUZ\'ZLE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [from the root of pose, which see.]<br><br>1. To perplex; to embarrass; to put to a stand; to gravel.<br><br>A shrewd disputant in those points, is dexterous in puzzling others.<br><br>He is perpetually puzzled and perplexed amidst his own blunders.<br><br>2. To make intricate; to entangle.<br><br>The ways of heaven are dark and intricate,<br><br>Puzzl\'d in mazes and perplex\'d with error.<br><br><b>PUZ\'ZLE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To be bewildered; to be awkward.<br><br><b>PUZ\'ZLE</b>, <i>n.</i> Perplexity; embarrassment.',
