    'definition': '<b>PYRAL\'LOLITE</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr. fire, and alluding to its changes of color before the blowpipe.] A new mineral found in Finland, massive and in crystals, friable and yielding to the knife. Its color is greenish.',
