  'Querl': {
    'id': 42861,
    'definition': '<b>QUERL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To twirl; to turn or wind round; to coil; as, to querl a cord, thread or rope. [This is a legitimate English word, in common use in New England. It may be a dialectical variation of whirl and twirl.]',
