  'Rapine': {
    'id': 43224,
    'definition': '<b>RAP\'INE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. rapina; rapio, to seize.]<br><br>1. The act of plundering; the seizing and carrying away of things by force.<br><br>2. Violence; force.<br><br><b>RAP\'INE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To plunder.',
