    'definition': '<b>RE-EXCHANGE</b>, <i>n.</i> [re and exchange.]<br><br>1. A renewed exchange.<br><br>2. In commerce, the exchange chargeable on the redraft of a bill of exchange.<br><br>The rate of re-exchange is regulated with respect to the drawer, at the course of exchange between the place where the bill of exchange was payable, and the place where it was drawn. Re-exchanges cannot be emulated.',
  },
  'Re-Export': {
    'id': 43411,
    'definition': '<b>RE-EXPORT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [re and export.] To export again; to export what has been imported. In the United States, a drawback is allowed on commodities re-exported.<br><br><b>RE-EX\'PORT</b>, <i>n.</i> Any commodity re-exported.',
  },
