  'Rebate': {
    'id': 43552,
    'definition': '<b>REBA\'TE</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> To blunt; to beat to obtuseness; to deprive of keenness.<br><br>He doth rebate and blunt his natural edge.<br><br>The keener edge of battle to rebate.',
