  'Recondite': {
    'id': 43781,
    'definition': '<b>REC\'ONDITE</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. reconditus, recondo; re and condo to conceal.]<br><br>1. Secret; hidden from the view or intellect; abstruse; as recondite causes of things.<br><br>2. Profound; dealing in things abstruse; as recondite studies.',
