    'definition': '<b>RECONNOIT\'ER</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> To view; to survey; to examine by the eye; particularly in military affairs, to examine the state of an enemy\'s army or camp, or the ground for military operations.',
  },
  'Reconnoitered': {
