  'Refluent': {
    'id': 44087,
    'definition': '<b>REF\'LUENT</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. refluens; re and fluo.]<br><br>1. Flowing back; ebbing; as the refluent tide.<br><br>2. Flowing back; returning, as a fluid; as refluent blood.',
