  'Refrigerant': {
    'id': 44126,
    'definition': '<b>REFRIG\'ERANT</b>, <i>a.</i> [See <a href="dict://Refrigerate">Refrigerate</a>.]<br><br>Cooling; allaying heat.<br><br><b>REFRIG\'ERANT</b>, <i>n.</i> Among physicians, a medicine which abates heat and refreshes the patient.',
