  'Reinstate': {
    'id': 44328,
    'definition': '<b>REINSTA\'TE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [re and instate.] To place again in possession or in a former state; to restore to a state from which one has been removed; as, to reinstate a king in the possession of the kingdom; to reinstate one in the affections of his family.',
