  'Reinsurance': {
    'id': 44332,
    'definition': '<b>REINSU\'RANCE</b>, <i>n.</i> [re and insurance. See <a href="dict://Sure">Sure</a>.]<br><br>An insurance of property already insured; a second insurance of the same property. Such reinsurance is permitted by the French commercial code; but in England is prohibited by statute, except when the first underwriter is insolvent.',
