  'Rill': {
    'id': 45608,
    'definition': '<b>RILL</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> A small brook; a rivulet; a streamlet.<br><br><b>RILL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> to run in a small stream, or in streamlets.',
