  'Ringent': {
    'id': 45623,
    'definition': '<b>RING\'ENT</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. ringor, to make wry faces, that is, to wring or twist.]<br><br>In botany, a ringent or labiate corol is one which is irregular, monopetalous, with the border usually divided into two parts called the upper and lower lip; or irregular and gaping, like the mouth of an animal.',
