  'Roguish': {
    'id': 45754,
    'definition': '<b>ROGUISH</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Vagrant; vagabond. [Nearly obsolete.]<br><br>2. Knavish; fraudulent; dishonest. [This is the present sense of the word.]<br><br>3. Waggish; wanton; slightly mischievous.',
