    'definition': '<b>RO\'MANIZE</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To latinize; to fill with Latin words or modes of speech.<br><br>2. To convert to the Roman catholic religion, or to papistical opinions.<br><br><b>RO\'MANIZE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To conform to Romish opinions, customs or modes of speech.',
