  'Rosaceous': {
    'id': 45847,
    'definition': '<b>ROSA\'CEOUS</b>, <i>a</i> s as z. [L. rosaceus. See <a href="dict://Rose">Rose</a>.]<br><br>Rose-like; composed of several petals, arranged in a circular form; as a rosaceous corol.',
