  'Rosin': {
    'id': 45867,
    'definition': '<b>ROS\'IN</b>, <i>n.</i> s as z. [This is only a different orthography of resin. L. resina. See <a href="dict://Resin">Resin</a>.]<br><br>1. Inspissated turpentine, a juice of the pine.<br><br>2. Any inspissated matter of vegetables that dissolves in spirit of wine.<br><br><b>ROS\'IN</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To rub with rosin.',
