    'definition': '<b>RU\'RAL</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. ruralis, from rus, the country.]<br><br>Pertaining to the country, as distinguished from a city or town; suiting the country, or resembling it; as rural scenes; a rural prospect; a rural situation; rural music.',
