  'Rye': {
    'id': 46162,
    'definition': '<b>RYE</b>, <i>n.</i> [This word is the English rough.]<br><br>1. An esculent grain of the genus Secale, of a quality inferior to wheat, but a species of grain easily cultivated, and constituting a large portion of bread stuff.<br><br>2. A disease in a hawk.',
