  'Scaffolding': {
    'id': 46679,
    'definition': '<b>SCAF\'FOLDING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A frame or structure for support in an elevated place.<br><br>2. That which sustains; a frame; as the scaffolding of the body.<br><br>3. Temporary structure for support.<br><br>4. Materials for scaffolds.',
