  'Scalade': {
    'id': 46681,
    'definition': '<b>SCALA\'DE,<br><br>SCALA\'DO</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. scala, a latter. See <a href="dict://Scale">Scale</a>.]<br><br>A storm or assault on a fortified place, in which the soldiers enter the place by means of ladders. It is written also escalade.',
