    'definition': '<b>SCOR\'PION-GRASS,<br><br>SCOR\'PION\'S TAIL</b>, <i>n.</i> A plant of the genus Scorpiurus, with trailing herbaceous stalks, and producing a pod resembling a caterpillar, whence it is called caterpillars.<br><br>The mouse-ear scorpion-grass, is of the genus Myosotis.',
