  'Scoundrel': {
    'id': 46965,
    'definition': '<b>SCOUN\'DREL</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. abscondo. ]<br><br>A mean, worthless fellow; a rascal; a low petty villain; a man without honor or virtue.<br><br>Go, if your ancient but ignoble blood has crept through scoundrels ever since the flood.<br><br><b>SCOUN\'DREL</b>, <i>a.</i> Low; base; mean; unprincipled.',
