  'Scouring': {
    'id': 46974,
    'definition': '<b>SCOUR\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Rubbing hard with something rough; cleaning by rubbing; cleansing with a drastic cathartic; ranging over for clearing.<br><br><b>SCOUR\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> A rubbing hard for cleaning; a cleansing by a drastic purge; looseness; flux.',
