  'Sea-Breeze': {
    'id': 47152,
    'definition': '<b>SE\'A-BREEZE</b>, <i>n.</i> [sea and breeze.] A wind or current of air blowing from the sea upon land; for the most part blowing during the day only, and subsiding at night.',
