    'definition': '<b>SE\'ALING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Fixing a seal; fastening with a seal; confirming; closing; keeping secret; fixing a piece of wood or iron in a wall with cement.<br><br><b>SE\'ALING</b>, <i>n.</i> [from <b>seal</b>, <i>the</i> animal] The operation of taking seals and curing their skins.',
