  'Sermonize': {
    'id': 47867,
    'definition': '<b>SER\'MONIZE</b>, <i>v.</i> i.<br><br>1. To preach.<br><br>2. To inculate rigid rules.<br><br>3. To make sermons; to compose or write a sermons or sermons. [This is the sense in which the verb is generally used in the U. States.]',
