    'definition': '<b>SER\'PENTIZE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To wind; to turn or bend, first in one direction and then in opposite; to meander<br><br>The road serpentized through a tall shrubbery. Barrow, Trav. in Africa.',
  },
  'Serpents-Tongue': {
