  'Shallowness': {
    'id': 48051,
    'definition': '<b>SHAL\'LOWNESS</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Want of depth; small depth; as the shallowness of water, of a river, of a stream.<br><br>2. Superficialness of intellect; want of power to enter deeply into subjects; emptiness; stillness.',
