  'Shamefully': {
    'id': 48065,
    'definition': '<b>SHA\'MEFULLY</b>, <i>adv.</i><br><br>1. Disgracefully; in a manner to bring reproach. He shamefully deserted his friend.<br><br>2. With indignity or indecency; in a manner that may cause shame.<br><br>How shamefully that maid he did torment. Spenser.',
