  'Shameless': {
    'id': 48067,
    'definition': '<b>SHA\'MELESS</b>, <i>a.</i> [shame and less.]<br><br>1. Destitute of shame; wanting modesty; impudent; brazen-faced; immodest; audacious; insensible to disgrace.<br><br>Such shameless bards we have. Pope.<br><br>2. Done without shame; indicating want of shame; as a shameless denial of truth.',
