  'Shamelessnes': {
    'id': 48069,
    'definition': '<b>SHA\'MELESSNES</b>, <i>n.</i> Destitution of shame; want of sensiblity to desgrace or dishonor; impudence.<br><br>He that blushes not at his crime, but adds shamelessness to shame, has nothing left to restore him to virture. Taylor.',
