  'Shank': {
    'id': 48076,
    'definition': '<b>SHANK</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The whole joint from the knee to the ankle. In a horse, th epart of the fore leg between the knee and footlock.<br><br>2. The tibia or large bone of the leg; as crooked shanks.<br><br>3. The long part of an instrument; as the shank of a key.<br><br>The beam or shaft of an anchor.<br><br>4. A plant. [bryonia.]',
