  'Shop': {
    'id': 48322,
    'definition': '<b>SHOP</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A builking in which goods, wares, drugs, &c. are sold by retail.<br><br>2. a building in which mechanics work, and where they keep their manufactures for sale.<br><br>Keep your shop, <i>and</i> your shop will keep you. Franklin.<br><br><b>SHOP</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To visit shops for purchasing goods; used chiefly in the participle; as, the laky is shopping.',
