    'definition': '<b>SHOP\'LIFTER</b>, <i>n.</i> [shop and lift. See <a href="dict://Lift">Lift</a>.] One who steals any thing from a shop, or takes goods privately from a shop; one who under pretense of buying goods, takes occasion the steal.',
