  'Shoulder-Blade': {
    'id': 48366,
    'definition': '<b>SHOULDER-BLADE</b>, <i>n.</i> [shoulder and blade.] The bone of the shoulder, or blade bone, broad and triangular, covering the hind part of the ribs; called by anatomists scapula and omoplata.',
