  'Shrew': {
    'id': 48398,
    'definition': '<b>SHREW</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A peevish, brawling, turbulent, vexatious woman. It appears to have originally been applied to males as well as females; but is now restricted to the latter.<br><br>The man had got a shrew for his wife, and there could be no quiet in the house with her. L\'Estrange.<br><br>2. A shrew-mouse.<br><br><b>SHREW</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To beshrew; to curse. Obs.',
