  'Siccative': {
    'id': 48479,
    'definition': '<b>SIC\'CATIVE</b>, <i>a.</i> [from L. sicco, <i>to</i> dry.] Drying; causing to dry.<br><br><b>SIC\'CATIVE</b>, <i>n.</i> That which promotes the process of drying.',
