  'Slightly': {
    'id': 49007,
    'definition': '<b>SLIGHTLY</b>, <i>adv.</i><br><br>1. Weakly; superficially; with inconsiderable force or effect; in a small degree; as a man slightly wounded; an audience slightly affected with preaching.<br><br>2. Negligently; without regard; with moderate contempt.',
