  'Slightness': {
    'id': 49008,
    'definition': '<b>SLIGHTNESS</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Weakness; want of force or strength; superficialness; as the slightness of a wound or an impression.<br><br>2. Negligence; want of attention; want of vehemence. How does it reproach the slightness of out sleepy heartless addresses!',
