  'Sliver': {
    'id': 49035,
    'definition': '<b>SLIV\'ER</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To cut or divide into long thin pieces, or into very small pieces; to cut or rend lengthwise; as, to sliver wood.<br><br><b>SLIV\'ER</b>, <i>n.</i> A long piece cut or rent off, or a piece cut or rent lengthwise. In Scotland, it is said to signify a slice; as a sliver of beef.',
