  'Sloat': {
    'id': 49036,
    'definition': '<b>SLOAT</b>, <i>n.</i> [from the root of L. claudo.] A narrow piece of timber which holds together larger pieces; as the sloats of a cart. [In New England, this is called a slat, as the slats of a chair, cart, & c.]',
