  'Slobber': {
    'id': 49037,
    'definition': '<b>SLOB\'BER</b>, <i>and</i> its derivatives, are a different orthography of slabber, the original pronunciation of which was probably slobber. [See <a href="dict://Slabber">Slabber</a> and Slaver.]',
