  'Sloe-Worm': {
    'id': 49040,
    'definition': '<b>SLOW-WORM, SLOE-WORM</b>, <i>n.</i> An insect found on the leaves of the sloe-tree, which often changes its skin and assumes different colors. It changes into a four winged fly.',
