  'Sluggard': {
    'id': 49079,
    'definition': '<b>SLUG\'GARD</b>, <i>n.</i> [from slug and ard, slow kind.] A person habitually lazy, idle and inactive; a drone.<br><br><b>SLUG\'GARD</b>, <i>a.</i> Sluggish; lazy.',
