  'Slut': {
    'id': 49098,
    'definition': '<b>SLUT</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A woman who is negligent of cleanliness, and who suffers her person, clothes, funiture, &c., to be dirty or in disorder.<br><br>2. A name of slight contempt for a woman.',
