  'Smallness': {
    'id': 49114,
    'definition': '<b>SMALL\'NESS</b>, <i>n.</i> Littleness of size or extent; littleness of quantity; as the smallness of a fly or of a horse; the smallness of a hill.<br><br>2. Littleness in degree; as the smallness of trouble or pain.<br><br>3. Littleness in force or strength; weakness; as smallness of mind or intellectual powers.<br><br>4. Fineness; softness; melodiousness; as the smallness of a female voice.<br><br>5. Littleness in amount of value; as the smallness of a sum.<br><br>6. Littleness of importance; inconsideratbleness; as the smallness of an affair.',
