    'definition': '<b>SM\'ARTLY</b>, <i>adv.</i><br><br>1. With keen pain; as, to ake smartly.<br><br>2. Briskly; sharply; wittily.<br><br>3. Vigorously; actively.',
  },
  'Smartness': {
    'id': 49126,
    'definition': '<b>SM\'ARTNESS</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The quality of being smart or pungent; poignancy; as the smartness of pain.<br><br>2. Quickness; vigor; as the smartness of a blow.<br><br>3. Liveliness; briskness; vivacity; wittiness; as the smartness of a reply or of a phrase.',
