  'Smatter': {
    'id': 49129,
    'definition': '<b>SMAT\'TER</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [It contains the elements of mutter.]<br><br>1. To talk superficially or ignorantly. Of state affairs you cannot smatter.<br><br>2. To have a slight taste, or a slight superficial knowledge.<br><br><b>SMAT\'TER</b>, <i>n.</i> Slight superficial knowledge.',
