  'Smear': {
    'id': 49132,
    'definition': '<b>SMEAR</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> 1. To overspread with any thing unctuous, viscous or adhesive; to besmear; to daub; as, to smear any thing with oil, butter, pitch, &c.<br><br>2. To soil; to contaminate; to pollute; as smeared with infamy.<br><br><b>SMEAR</b>, <i>n.</i> A fat oily substance; ointment. [Little used.]',
