    'id': 49271,
    'definition': '<b>SNEEZE</b>, <i>v.i.<br><br></i> To emit air through the nose audibly and violently, by a kind of involuntary convulsive force, occasioned by irriatation of the inner membrance of the nose. Thus snuff or any thing that tickles the nose, makes one sneeze.<br><br><b>SNEEZE</b>, <i>n.</i> A sudden and violent ejection of air through the nose with an audible sound.',
