  'Snicker': {
    'id': 49279,
    'definition': '<b>SNICK\'ER, SNIG\'GER</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [This can have no connection with sneer. the elements and the sense are different.] To laugh slily; or to laugh in one\'s sleeve. [It is a word in common use in New WNgland, not easily defined. It signifies to laugh with small audible catches of voice, as when persons attempt to suppress loud laughter.]',
