  'Snore': {
    'id': 49296,
    'definition': '<b>SNORE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [from the root of L. naris, the nose or nostrils.] To breathe with a rough hoarse noise in sleep.<br><br><b>SNORE</b>, <i>n.</i> A breathing with a harse noise in sleep.',
