  'Snort': {
    'id': 49299,
    'definition': '<b>SNORT</b>, <i>v.i.</i><br><br>1. To force the air with violence through the nose, so as to make a noise, as high spirited horses in prancing and play.<br><br>2. To snore. [Not common.]<br><br><b>SNORT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To turn up in anger, scorn or derision, as the nose. [Unusual.]',
