  'Snout': {
    'id': 49305,
    'definition': '<b>SNOUT</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The long projecting nose of a beast, as that of swine.<br><br>2. The nose of a man; in contempt.<br><br>3. The nozzle or end of a hollow pipe.<br><br><b>SNOUT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To furnish with a nozzle or point.',
