  'Snowball': {
    'id': 49316,
    'definition': '<b>SNOWBALL</b>, <i>n.</i> [snow and ball.] A round mass of snow, pressed or rolled together.<br><br><b>SNOWBALL TREE</b>, <i>n.</i> A flowering shrub of the genus Virburnum; gelder rose.',
