    'definition': '<b>SOAP</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. sapo.] A compound of oil and alkali, or oil and earth, and metallic oxyds; usually, a compound of oil and vegetable alkali or lye; used in washing and cleansing, in medicine, &c.<br><br><b>SOAP</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To rub or wash over with soap.<br><br><b>SOAPHERRY TREE</b>, <i>n.</i> A tree of the genus Sapindus.',
