    'definition': '<b>SOCRAT\'IC, SOCRAT\'ICAL</b>, <i>a.</i> Pertaining to Socrates, the Grecian sage, or his language or manner of teaching and philosophizing. The Socratic metod of resoning and instruction was by inter rugatories.',
