  'Soporiferous': {
    'id': 49594,
    'definition': '<b>SOPORIF\'EROUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. soporifer; sopor, asleep, and fero, to bring; from sopio, to lull to sleep.] Causing sleep, or tending to produce it; narcotic; opiate; anodyne; somniferous. The poppy pssesses soporiferous qualities.',
