  'Sorcery': {
    'id': 49611,
    'definition': '<b>SOR\'CERY</b>, <i>n.</i> Magic; enchantment; witchcraft; divination be the assistance of evil spirits, or the power of commanding evil spirits. Adder\'s wisdom I have learn\'d to fence my ears against the sorceries.',
