    'id': 49618,
    'definition': '<b>SOR\'DIDNESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Filthiness; dirtiness.<br><br>2. Meanness; baseness; as the execrable sordidness of the delights of Tiberius.<br><br>3. Niggardliness.',
