  'Sorites': {
    'id': 49626,
    'definition': '<b>SORI\'TES</b>, <i>n.</i> In logic, an argument where one proposition is accumulated on another. Thus, all men of revenge have their souls often uneasy. Uneasy souls are a plague to themselves. Now to be one\'s own plague is folly in the extreme.',
