  'Sororicide': {
    'id': 49628,
    'definition': '<b>SOROR\'ICIDE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. soror, sister, and cado, to strike, to kill.] The murder or murderer of a sister. [Little used, and obviously because the crime is very infrequent.',
