  'Sorrily': {
    'id': 49633,
    'definition': '<b>SOR\'RILY</b>, <i>adv.</i> [from sorry.] Meanly; despicably; pitiably; in a wretched manner. Thy pipe, O Pan, shall help though I sing sorrily.',
