  'Sorrowful': {
    'id': 49637,
    'definition': '<b>SOR\'ROWFUL</b>, <i>A.<br><br></i> 1. Sad; grieving for the loss of some good, or on account of some expected evil.<br><br>2. Deeply serious; depressed; dejected. I Sam. 1.<br><br>3. Producing sorrow; exciting grief; mournful; as a sorrowful accident.<br><br>4. Expressing grief; accompanied with grief; as sorrowful meat. Job 6.',
