  'Sottishness': {
    'id': 49656,
    'definition': '<b>SOT\'TISHNESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Dullness in the exercise reason; stupidity. Few consider into what a degree of sottishness and confirmed ignorance men may sin themselves.<br><br>2. Stupidity from intoxication.',
