    'definition': '<b>SOUTH\'ING</b>, <i>a.</i> Going towards the south; as the southing sun.<br><br><b>SOUTH\'ING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Tendency or motion to the south.<br><br>2. The southing of the moon, the time at which the moon passes the meridian.<br><br>3. Course or distance south; as a ship\'s southing.',
