  },
  'Spacious': {
    'id': 49730,
    'definition': '<b>SPA\'CIOUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. spatiosus.]<br><br>1. Wide; roomy; having large or ample room; not narrow; as a spacious church; a spacious hall or drawing room.<br><br>2. Extensive; vast in extent; as the spacious earth; the spacious ocean.',
