  'Spaciousness': {
    'id': 49732,
    'definition': '<b>SPA\'CIOUSNESS</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. Wideness; largeness of extent; roominess; as the spaciousness of the rooms in a building.<br><br>2. Extensiveness; vastness of extent; as the spaciousness of the ocean.',
