  'Spade': {
    'id': 49734,
    'definition': '<b>SPADE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. spatula, from the root of pateo.]<br><br>1. An instrument for digging, consisting of a broad palm with a handle.<br><br>2. A suit of cards.<br><br>3. A deer three years old; written also spaid.<br><br>4. A gelded beast. [L. spado.]',
