  'Spadeful': {
    'id': 49736,
    'definition': '<b>SPA\'DEFUL</b>, <i>n.</i> [spade and full.] As much as a spade will hold.<br><br><b>SPADI"CEOUS</b>, <i>a.</i> [L. spadiceus, from spadix, a light red color.]<br><br>1. Of a light red color, usually denominated bay.<br><br>2. In botany, a spadiceous flower, is a sort of aggregate flower, having a receptacle common to many florets, within a spathe, as in palms, dracontium, arum, &c.',
