  'Spang': {
    'id': 49754,
    'definition': '<b>SPANG</b>, <i>n.</i> A spangle or shining ornament; a thin piece of shining metal; something brilliant used as an ornament.<br><br>2. An y little thing sparkling and brilliant like pieces of metal; as crystals of ice. For the rich spangles that adorn the sky.',
