  'Spaniel': {
    'id': 49758,
    'definition': '<b>SPAN\'IEL</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A dog used in sports of the field, remarkable for his sagacity and obedience.<br><br>2. A mean, cringing, fawning person.<br><br><b>SPAN\'IEL</b>, <i>a.</i> Like a spaniel; mean; fawning.<br><br><b>SPAN\'IEL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> TO fawn; to cringe; to be obsequious.<br><br><b>SPAN\'IEL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To follow like a spaniel.',
