  'Speedy': {
    'id': 49900,
    'definition': '<b>SPEE\'DY</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Quick; swift; nimble; hasty; rapid in motion; as a speedy flight; on speedy foot.<br><br>2. Quick in performance; not dilatory or slow; as a speedy dispatch of business.',
