  'Spelling': {
    'id': 49907,
    'definition': '<b>SPELL\'ING</b>, <i>ppr.<br><br></i> 1. Naming the letters of a word, or writing them; forming words with their proper letters.<br><br>2. Taking another\'s turn.<br><br><b>SPELL\'ING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The act of naming the letters of a word, or the act of writing or printing words with their proper letters.<br><br>2. Orthography; the manner of forming words with letters. Bad spelling is disreputable to a gentleman.',
