  'Spicy': {
    'id': 49966,
    'definition': '<b>SPI\'CY</b>, <i>a.</i> [from spice.]<br><br>1. Producing spice; abounding with spices; as the spicy shore of Arabia.<br><br>2. Having the qualities of spice; fragrant; aromatic; as spicy plants. Led by new stars and borne by spicy gales.',
