  'Spider': {
    'id': 49967,
    'definition': '<b>SPI\'DER</b>, <i>n.</i> [I know not from what source this word is derived.] The common name of the insects of the genus Aranea, remarkable for spinning webs for taking their prey and forming a convenient habitation, and for the deposit of their food. The spider\'s touch, how exquisitely fine!',
