  'Spitter': {
    'id': 50058,
    'definition': '<b>SPITTER</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. One that puts meat on a spit.<br><br>2. One who ejects saliva from his mouth.<br><br>3. A young deer whose horns begin to shoot or become sharp; a brocket or pricket.',
