  'Spittle': {
    'id': 50060,
    'definition': '<b>SPITTLE</b>, <i>n.</i> [from spit.]<br><br>1. Saliva; the thick moist matter which is secreted by the salivary glands and ejected from the mouth.<br><br>2. A small sort of spade. [spaddle.]<br><br><b>SPITTLE</b>. [See <a href="dict://Spital">Spital</a>.]<br><br><b>SPITTLE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To dig or stir with a small spade. [Local.]',
