  'Splanchnology': {
    'id': 50062,
    'definition': '<b>SPLANCHNOLOGY</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr., bowels, discourse.]<br><br>1. The doctrine of the viscera; or a treatise or description of the viscera.<br><br>2. The doctrine of diseases of the internal parts of the body.',
