  'Splash': {
    'id': 50063,
    'definition': '<b>SPLASH</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [formed on plash.] To spatter with water, or with water and mud.<br><br><b>SPLASH</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To strike and dash about water.<br><br><b>SPLASH</b>, <i>n.</i> Water or water and dirt thrown upon any thing, or thrown from a puddle and the like.',
