  'Splay': {
    'id': 50065,
    'definition': '<b>SPLAY</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [See <a href="dict://Display">Display</a>.]<br><br>1. To dislocate or break a horses shoulder bone.<br><br>2. To spread. [Little used.]<br><br><b>SPLAY</b>, <i>for</i> display. [Not in use.]<br><br><b>SPLAY</b>, <i>a.</i> Displayed; spread; turned outward.',
