  'Spleenful': {
    'id': 50071,
    'definition': '<b>SPLEENFUL</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Angry; peevish; fretful.<br><br>Myself have calmd their spleenful mutiny.<br><br>2. Melancholy; hypochondriacal.',
