  'Springing': {
    'id': 50198,
    'definition': '<b>SPRINGING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Arising; shooting up; leaping; proceeding; rousing.<br><br>Sprining use, in law, a contingent use; a use which may arise upon a contingency.<br><br><b>SPRINGING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act or process of leaping, arising, issuing or proceeding.<br><br>2. Growth; increase. Psa 65.<br><br>3. In building, the side of an arch contiguous to the part on which it rests.',
