    'definition': '<b>SPRINKLING</b>, <i>ppr.</i><br><br>1. Dispersing, as a liquid or as dust.<br><br>2. Scattering on, in fine drops or particles.<br><br><b>SPRINKLING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of scattering in small drops or parcels.<br><br>2. A small quantity falling in distinct drops or parts, or coming moderately; as a sprinkling of rain or snow.',
