  'Sprit': {
    'id': 50205,
    'definition': '<b>SPRIT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [G.] To throw out with force from a narrow orifice; to eject; to spirt. [Not in use. See <a href="dict://Spurt">Spurt</a>.]<br><br><b>SPRIT</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A shoot; a sprout.<br><br>2. A small boom, pole or spar which crosses the sail of a boat diagonally from the mast to the upper aftmost corner, which it is used to extend and elevate.',
