  'Spungy': {
    'id': 50241,
    'definition': '<b>SPUNGY</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Soft and full of cavities; of an open, loose, pliable texture; as a spungy excrescence; spungy earth; spungy cake; the spungy substance of the lungs.<br><br>2. Full of small cavities; as spungy bones.<br><br>3. Wet; drenched; soaked and soft, like spunge.<br><br>4. Having the quality of imbibing fluids.',
