  'Spunk': {
    'id': 50242,
    'definition': '<b>SPUNK</b>, <i>n.</i> [probably from punk.]<br><br>1. Touchwood; wood that readily takes fire. Hence,<br><br>2. Vulgarly, an inflammable temper; spirit; as a man of spunk. Ill natured observations touched his spunk. [Low.]',
