  'Squally': {
    'id': 50296,
    'definition': '<b>SQUALLY</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Abounding with squalls disturbed often with sudden and violent gust of wind; as squally weather.<br><br>2. In agriculture, broken into detached pieces; interrupted by unproductive spots. [Local.]',
