  'Star-Shoot': {
    'id': 50503,
    'definition': '<b>STAR-SHOOT</b>, <i>n.</i> [star and shoot.] That which is emitted from a star.<br><br>I have seen a good quantity of that jelly, by the vulgar called a star-shoot, as if it remained upon the extinction of a falling star.<br><br>[The writer once saw the same kind of substance from a brilliant meteor, at Amherst in Massachusetts. See <a href="dict://Journ">Journ</a>. Of Science for a description of it by Rufus Graves, Esq.]',
