  'Starlight': {
    'id': 50524,
    'definition': '<b>STARLIGHT</b>, <i>n.</i> [star and light.] The light proceeding from the stars.<br><br>Nor walk by moon or glittering starlight, without thee is sweet.<br><br><b>STARLIGHT</b>, <i>a.</i> Lighted by the stars, or by the stars only; as a starlight evening.',
