  'Starlike': {
    'id': 50525,
    'definition': '<b>STARLIKE</b>, <i>a.</i> [star and like.]<br><br>1. Resembling a star; stellated; radiated like a star; as starlike flowers.<br><br>2. Bright; illustrious.<br><br>The having turned many to righteousness shall confer a starlike and immortal brightness.',
