    'definition': '<b>STATED</b>, <i>pp.</i><br><br>1. Expressed or represented; told; recited.<br><br>2. a. Settled; established; regular; occurring at regular times; not occasional; as stated hours of business.<br><br>3. Fixed; established; as a stated salary.',
