  'Stateliness': {
    'id': 50557,
    'definition': '<b>STATELINESS</b>, <i>n.</i> [from stately.]<br><br>1. Grandeur; loftiness of mien or manner; majestic appearance; dignity.<br><br>For stateliness and majesty, what is comparable to a horse?<br><br>2. Appearance of pride; affected dignity.',
