  'Statement': {
    'id': 50559,
    'definition': '<b>STATEMENT</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of stating, reciting or presenting verbally or on paper.<br><br>2. A series of facts or particulars expressed on paper; as a written statement.<br><br>3. A series of facts verbally recited; recital of the circumstances of a transaction; as a verbal statement.',
