  'Statuary': {
    'id': 50578,
    'definition': '<b>STATUARY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L., a statue; to set.]<br><br>1. The art of carving images as representatives of real persons or things; a branch of sculpture.<br><br>[In this sense the word has no plural.]<br><br>2. One professes or practices the art of carving images or making statues.<br><br>On other occasions the statuaries took their subjects from the poets.',
