  'Statue': {
    'id': 50579,
    'definition': '<b>STATUE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L., to set; that which is set or fixed.] An image; a solid substance formed by carving into the likeness of a whole living being; as a statue of Hercules or of a lion.<br><br><b>STATUE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To place, as a statue; to form a statue of.',
