  'Stays': {
    'id': 50604,
    'definition': '<b>STAYS</b>, <i>n.</i> plu.<br><br>1. A bodice; a kind of waistcoat stiffened with whalebone or other thing, worn by females.<br><br>2. Stays, of a ship. [See <a href="dict://Stay">Stay</a>.]<br>3. Station; fixed anchorage.<br><br>4. Any support; that which keeps another extended.<br><br>Weavers, stretch your stays upon the weft.',
