  'Stearin': {
    'id': 50625,
    'definition': '<b>STEARIN</b>, <i>n.</i> One of the proximate elements of animal fat, as lard, tallow, &c. The various kinds of animal fat consist of two substances, stearin and elain; of which the former is solid, and the latter liquid.',
