  'Steeple': {
    'id': 50650,
    'definition': '<b>STEEPLE</b>, <i>n.</i> A turret of a church, ending in a point; a spire. It differs from a tower, which usually ends in a square form, thought the name is sometimes given to a tower. The bell of a church is usually hung in the steeple.<br><br>They, far from steeples and their sacred sound---',
