  'Stereography': {
    'id': 50729,
    'definition': '<b>STEREOGRAPHY</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr., firm; to write.] The act or art of delineating the forms of solid bodies on a plane; a branch of solid geometry which shows the construction of all solids which are regularly defined.',
