    'definition': '<b>STERNNESS</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Severity of look; a look of austerity, rigor or severe authority; as the sternness of ones presence.<br><br>2. Severity or harshness of manner; rigor.<br><br>I have sternness in my soul enough to hear of soldiers work.',
