  'Stillatory': {
    'id': 50821,
    'definition': '<b>STILLATORY</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. An alembic; a vessel for distillation. [Little used or not at all.]<br><br>2. A laboratory; a place or room in which distillation is performed. [Little used.]',
