  'Stilling': {
    'id': 50826,
    'definition': '<b>STILLING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Calming; silencing; quieting.<br><br><b>STILLING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of calming, silencing or quieting.<br><br>2. A stand for casks. [Not used in America.]',
