  'Stitching': {
    'id': 50893,
    'definition': '<b>STITCHING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Sewing in a particular manner; uniting with a needle and thread.<br><br><b>STITCHING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of stitching.<br><br>2. Work done by sewing in a particular manner.<br><br>3. The forming of land into ridges or divisions.',
