  'Stoic': {
    'id': 50919,
    'definition': '<b>STOIC</b>, <i>n.</i> [Gr., a porch in Athens where the philosopher Zeno taught.] A disciple of the philosopher Zeno, who founded a sect. He taught that men should be free from passion, unmoved by joy or grief, and submit without complaint to the unavoidable necessity by which all things are governed.',
