  'Stomachical': {
    'id': 50936,
    'definition': '<b>STOMACHIC, STOMACHICAL</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Pertaining to the stomach; as stomachic vessels.<br><br>2. Strengthening to the stomach; exciting the action of the stomach.<br><br><b>STOMACHIC</b>, <i>n.</i> A medicine that excites the action and strengthens the tone of the stomach.',
