  'Storied': {
    'id': 51006,
    'definition': '<b>STORIED</b>, <i>a.</i> [from story.]<br><br>1. Furnished with stories; adorned with historical paintings.<br><br>Some greedy minion or imperious wife, the trophied arches, storied halls, invade.<br><br>2. Related in story; told or recited in history.',
