    'definition': '<b>STOUND</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Sorrow; grief. [Not in use.]<br><br>2. A shooting pain. [Not in use.]<br><br>3. Noise. [Not in use.]<br><br>4. Astonishment; amazement. [Not in use.]<br><br>5. Hour; time; season. [Not in use.]<br><br>6. A vessel to put small beer in.',
