  'Street': {
    'id': 51124,
    'definition': '<b>STREET</b>, <i>n.</i> [L., strewed or spread. See <a href="dict://Strew">Strew</a>.]<br><br>1. Properly, a paved way or road; but in usage, any way or road in a city, chiefly a main way, in distinction from a lane or alley.<br><br>2. Among the people of New England, any public highway.<br><br>3. Streets, plural, any public way, road or place.<br><br>That there be no complaining in our streets. Psa 144.',
