  'Striated': {
    'id': 51150,
    'definition': '<b>STRIATE, STRIATED</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Formed with small channels; channeled.<br><br>2. In botany, streaked; marked or scored with superficial or very slender lines; marked with fine parallel lines.<br><br>Striated fracture, in mineralogy, consists of long narrow separable parts laid on or beside each other.',
