  'Stringhalt': {
    'id': 51176,
    'definition': '<b>STRINGHALT</b>, <i>n.</i> [string and halt.] A sudden twitching of the hinder leg of a horse, or an involuntary or convulsive motion of the muscles that extend or bend the hough. [This word in some of the United States, is corrupted into springhalt.]',
