  'Stroll': {
    'id': 51203,
    'definition': '<b>STROLL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> [formed probably on troll, roll.] To rove; to wander on foot; to ramble idly or leisurely.<br><br>These mothers stroll to beg sustenance for their helpless infants.<br><br><b>STROLL</b>, <i>n.</i> A wandering on foot; a walking idly and leisurely.',
