  'Strontianite': {
    'id': 51218,
    'definition': '<b>STRONTIANITE</b>, <i>n.</i> Carbonate of strontian, a mineral that occurs massive, fibrous, stellated, and crystalized in the form of a hexahedral prism, modified on the edges, or terminated by a pyramid.<br><br>Prismatic baryte, a species of heavy spar.',
