    'definition': '<b>STROP</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A strap. [See <a href="dict://Strap">Strap</a>.] This orthography is particularly used for a strip of lether used for sharpening razors and giving them a fine smooth edge; a razor-strop. But strap is preferable.<br><br>2. A piece of rope spliced into a circular wreath, and put round a block for hanging it.',
