  'Strut': {
    'id': 51241,
    'definition': '<b>STRUT</b>, <i>v.i.</i><br><br>1. To walk with a lofty proud gait and erect head; to walk with affected dignity.<br><br>Does he not hold up his head and strut in his gait?<br><br>2. To swell; to protuberate.<br><br>The bellying canvas strutted with the gale. [Not used.]<br><br><b>STRUT</b>, <i>n.</i> A lofty proud step or walk with the head erect; affectation of dignity in walking.',
