  'Strychnia': {
    'id': 51246,
    'definition': '<b>STRYCHNIA</b>, <i>n.</i> An alkaline substance obtained from the fruit of the Strychnos nux vomica, and Strychnos ignatia. It is a white substance, crystalized in very small four sided prisms, and intolerably bitter. It acts upon the stomach with violent energy, inducing locked jaw and destroying life.',
