  'Stubbornness': {
    'id': 51256,
    'definition': '<b>STUBBORNNESS</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Perverse and unreasonable obstinacy; inflexibility; contumacy.<br><br>Stubbornness and obstinate disobedience must be mastered with blows.<br><br>2. Stiffness; want of pliancy.<br><br>3. Refractoriness, as of ores.',
