  'Stucco': {
    'id': 51258,
    'definition': '<b>STUCCO</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A fine plaster composed of lime, sand, whiting and pounded marble; used for covering walls, &c.<br><br>2. Work made of stucco.<br><br><b>STUCCO</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To plaster; to overlay with fine plaster.',
