    'definition': '<b>STUFFING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Filling; crowding.<br><br><b>STUFFING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. That which is used for filling any thing; as the stuffing of a saddle or cushion.<br><br>2. Seasoning for meat; that which is put into meat to give it a higher relish.',
