  'Stumbling-Stone': {
    'id': 51290,
    'definition': '<b>STUMBLING-BLOCK, STUMBLING-STONE</b>, <i>n.</i> [stumble and block or stone.] Any cause of stumbling; that which causes to err.<br><br>We preach Christ crucified, to the Jews a stumbling-block, and to the Greeks foolishness. 1 Cor 1.<br><br>This stumbling stone we hope to take away.',
