  'Stump': {
    'id': 51291,
    'definition': '<b>STUMP</b>, <i>n.</i> [G.]<br><br>1. The stub of a tree; the part of a tree remaining int he earth after the tree is cut down, or the part of any plant left in the earth by the sythe or sickle.<br><br>2. The part of a limb or other body remaining after a part is amputated or destroyed; as the stump of a leg, of a finger or a tooth.<br><br><b>STUMP</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To strike any thing fixed and hard with the toe. [Vulgar.<br><br>2. To challenge. [Vulgar.]',
