  'Stun': {
    'id': 51293,
    'definition': '<b>STUN</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [The primary sense is to strike or to stop, to blunt, to stupefy.]<br><br>1. To make senseless or dizzy with a blow on the head; as, to be stunned by a fall, or by a falling timber.<br><br>One hung a pole-ax at his saddle bow, and one a heavy mace to stun the foe.<br><br>2. To overpower the sense of hearing; to blunt or stupefy the organs of hearing. To prevent being stunned, cannoneers sometimes fill their ears with wool.<br><br>3. To confound or make dizzy by loud and mingled sound.<br><br>--An universal hubbub wild of stunning sounds and voices all confusd.',
  },
