  'Stunt': {
    'id': 51298,
    'definition': '<b>STUNT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [See <a href="dict://Stint">Stint</a>.] To hinder from growth; applied to animals and plants; as, to stunt a child; to stunt a plant.',
