  'Suavity': {
    'id': 51351,
    'definition': '<b>SUAVITY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L.]<br><br>1. Sweetness, in a literal sense. [Not in use.]<br><br>2. Sweetness, in a figurative sense; that which is to the mind what sweetness is to the tongue; agreeableness; softness; pleasantness; as suavity of manners; suavity of language, conversation or address.',
