  'Sub': {
    'id': 51352,
    'definition': '<b>SUB</b>, <i>a</i> Latin preposition, denoting under or below, used in English as a prefix, to express a subordinate degree. Before f and p it is changed into those letters, as in suffer, and suppose; and before m, into that letter, as in summon.',
