  'Subduct': {
    'id': 51404,
    'definition': '<b>SUBDUCE, SUBDUCT</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [L., sub and duco, to draw.]<br>1. To withdraw; to take away.<br><br>Or from my side subducting, took perhaps more than enough.<br><br>2. To subtract by arithmetical operation.<br><br>If out of that infinite multitude of antecedent generations we should subduct ten--',
