  'Suffocation': {
    'id': 51724,
    'definition': '<b>SUFFOCA\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> The act of choking or stifling; a stopping of respiration, either by intercepting the passage of air to and from the lungs, or by inhaling smoke, dust or air that is not respirable.<br><br>1. The act of stifling, destroying or extinguishing.',
