  'Suggestion': {
    'id': 51754,
    'definition': '<b>SUGGES\'TION</b>, <i>n.</i> A hint; a first intimation, proposal or mention. The measure was adopted at the suggestion of an eminent philosopher.<br><br>1. Presentation of an idea to the mind; as the suggestions of fancy or imagination; the suggestions of conscience.<br><br>2. Insinuation; secret notification or incitement.<br><br>3. In law, information without oath.',
