  'Suicide': {
    'id': 51760,
    'definition': '<b>SU\'ICIDE</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. suicidium; se and coedo, to slay.]<br><br>1. Self-murder; the act of designedly destroying one\'s own life. To constitute suicide, the person must be of years of discretion and of sound mind.<br><br>2. One guilty of self-murder; a felo de se.',
