  'Swag': {
    'id': 52298,
    'definition': '<b>SWAG</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To sink down by its weight; to lean.<br><br><b>SWAG\'-BELLIED</b>, <i>a.</i> Having a prominent overhanging belly.',
