  'Swain': {
    'id': 52305,
    'definition': '<b>SWAIN</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A young man.<br><br>2. A country servant employed in husbandry.<br><br>3. A pastoral youth. [It is used chiefly in this sense, and in poetry.]<br><br>Blest swains! whose nymphs in every grace excel.',
