  'Swallowing': {
    'id': 52318,
    'definition': '<b>SWAL\'LOWING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Taking into the stomach; absorbing; ingulfing; receiving implicitly; engrossing; wasting; exhausting.<br><br><b>SWAL\'LOWING</b>, <i>n.</i> The act of taking into the stomach or of absorbing; the act of receiving implicitly; the act of engrossing.',
