  'Tastelessness': {
    'id': 52921,
    'definition': '<b>TASTELESSNESS</b>, <i>n.</i> Want of taste or relish; insipidness; as the tastelessness of fruit.<br><br>1. Want of perception of taste. [Not in use.]<br><br>2. Want of intellectual relish. [Not in use.]',
