  'Tasty': {
    'id': 52925,
    'definition': '<b>TASTY</b>, <i>a.</i> Having a good taste, or nice perception of excellence; applied to persons; as a tasty lady.<br><br>1. Being in conformity to the principles of good taste; elegant; as tasty furniture; a tasty dress.',
