  'Tatter': {
    'id': 52926,
    'definition': '<b>TAT\'TER</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To rend or tear into rags. [Not used except in the participle.]<br><br><b>TAT\'TER</b>, <i>n.</i> A rag, or a part torn and hanging to the thing; chiefly used in the plural, tatters.',
