  'Tattle': {
    'id': 52929,
    'definition': '<b>TAT\'TLE</b>, <i>v.i.<br><br></i> 1. To prate; to talk idly; to use many words with little meaning.<br><br>Excuse it by the tattling quality of age, which is always narrative.<br><br>2. To tell tales; to communicate secrets; as a tattling girl.<br><br><b>TAT\'TLE</b>, <i>n.</i> Prate, idle talk or chat; trifling talk.<br><br>They told the tattle of the day.',
