  'Tattoo': {
    'id': 52932,
    'definition': '<b>TATTOO\'</b>, <i>n.</i> [Eng. tap.] A beat of drum at night, giving notice to soldiers to retreat, or to repair to their quarters in garrison, or to their tents in camp.<br><br><b>TATTOO\'</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [In the South Sea isles.] To prick the skin, and stain the punctured spots with a black substance, forming lines and figures upon the body. In some isles, the inhabitants tattoo the face, in others only the body. The same practice exists among other rude nations.<br><br><b>TATTOO\'</b>, <i>n.</i> Figures on the body made by punctures and stains in lines and figures.',
  },
  'Tattooed': {
