  'Tautologic': {
    'id': 52945,
    'definition': '<b>TAUTOLOG\'IC<br><br>TAUTOLOG\'ICAL</b>, <i>a.</i> [See <a href="dict://Tautology">Tautology</a>.] Repeating the same thing; having the same signification; as a tautological expression or phrase.<br><br>Tautological echo, an echo that repeats the same sound or syllable many times.',
