    'definition': '<b>TAW\'DRINESS</b>, <i>n.</i> [from tawdry.] Tinsel in dress; excessive finery; ostentatious finery without elegance.<br><br>A clumsy person makes his ungracefulness more ungraceful by tawdriness of dress.',
