  'Tawdry': {
    'id': 52957,
    'definition': '<b>TAW\'DRY</b>, <i>a.</i> Very fine and showy in colors without taste or elegance; having an excess of showy ornaments without grace; as a tawdry dress; tawdry feathers; tawdry colors.<br><br>He rails from morning to night at essenced fops and tawdry courtiers.<br><br><b>TAW\'DRY</b>, <i>n.</i> A slight ornament.',
