  'Tea': {
    'id': 52971,
    'definition': '<b>TEA</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The leaves of the tea-tree as dried and imported. There are several kinds of tea, as imperial tea, hyson and young hyson, called green teas; souchong and bohea, called black teas, &c.<br><br>3. Any infusion or decoction of vegetables; as sage tea; camomile tea, &c.',
