  'Trapezihedron': {
    'id': 54525,
    'definition': '<b>TRAPEZIHE\'DRON</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. trapezium and Gr. side.]<br><br>A solid bounded by twenty four equal and similar trapeziums.',
  },
  'Trapezium': {
    'id': 54526,
    'definition': '<b>TRAPE\'ZIUM</b>, <i>n.</i> plu. trapezia or trapeziums. [L. from Gr. a little table.]<br><br>1. In geometry, a plane figure contained under four unequal right lines, none of them parallel.<br><br>2. In anatomy, a bone of the carpus.',
