  'Trapezoid': {
    'id': 54527,
    'definition': '<b>TRAPEZOID\'</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. trapezium.] An irregular solid figure having four sides, no two of which are parallel to each other; also, a plane four sided figure having two of the opposite sides parallel to each other.',
