    'definition': '<b>UNANIM\'ITY</b>, <i>n.</i> [L. unus, one, and animus, mind.]<br><br>Agreement of a number of persons in opinion or determination; as, there was perfect unanimity among the members of the council.',
  },
  'Unanimous': {
    'id': 55530,
    'definition': '<b>UNAN\'IMOUS</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Being of one mind; agreeing in opinion or determination; as, the house of assembly was unanimous; the members of the council were unanimous.<br><br>2. Formed by unanimity; as a unanimous vote.',
