    'id': 55546,
    'definition': '<b>UNAPPE\'ASABLE</b>, <i>a.</i> s as z.<br><br>1. Not to be appeased or pacified; as an unappeasable clamor.<br><br>2. Not placable; as unappeasable wrath.',
