    'definition': '<b>UNAPPRO\'PRIATED</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not appropriated; not applied or directed to be applied to any specific object; as money or funds.<br><br>2. Not granted or given to any person, company or corporation; as unappropriated lands.',
