    'id': 55567,
    'definition': '<b>UN\'ARMED</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not having an arms or armor; not equipped. Man is born unarmed. It is mean to attack even an enemy unarmed.<br><br>2. Not furnished with scales, prickles or other defense; as animals and plants.',
  },
