    'definition': '<b>UNBIT\'</b>, <i>a.</i> Not bitten.<br><br><b>UNBIT\'</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> 1. In seamanship, to remove the turns of a cable from off the bits.<br><br>2. To unbridle.',
  },
