  'Unbolted': {
    'id': 55733,
    'definition': '<b>UNBOLTED</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Freed from fastening by bolts.<br><br>2. Unsifted; not bolted; not having the bran or coarse part separated by a bolter; as unbolted meal.',
