  'Unbroke': {
    'id': 55769,
    'definition': '<b>UNBRO\'KE,\'KEN</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not broken; not violated. Preserve your vows unbroken.<br><br>2. Not weakened; not crushed; not subdued.<br><br>How broad his shoulders spread, by age unbroke.<br><br>3. Not tamed; not taught; not accustomed to the saddle, harness or yoke; as an unbroken horse or ox.',
  },
  'Unbrotherly': {
