    'definition': '<b>UNCOM\'MON</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not common; not usual; rare; as an uncommon season; an uncommon degree of cold or heat; uncommon courage.<br><br>2. Not frequent; not often seen or known; as an uncommon production.',
