  'Uncondemned': {
    'id': 55974,
    'definition': '<b>UNCONDEM\'NED</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not condemned; not judged guilty.<br><br>- A man that is a Roman, and uncondemned. Acts 22.<br><br>2. Not disapproved; not pronounced criminal; as a practice yet uncondemned.',
