  'Underpin': {
    'id': 56256,
    'definition': '<b>UNDERPIN\'</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> 1. To lay stones under the sills of a building, on which it is to rest.<br><br>2. To support by some solid foundation; or to place something underneath for support.',
