    'definition': '<b>UNDERPIN\'NING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Placing stones under the sills for support.<br><br><b>UNDERPIN\'NING</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. The act of laying stones under sills.<br><br>2. The stones on which a building immediately rests.',
  },
  'Underplot': {
    'id': 56259,
    'definition': '<b>UN\'DERPLOT</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A series of events in a play, proceeding collaterally with the main story, and subservient to it.<br><br>2. A clandestine scheme.',
  },
