    'definition': '<b>UNDESERV\'ING</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not deserving; not having merit. God continually supplies the wants of his undeserving creatures.<br><br>2. Not meriting; with of; as a man undeserving of happiness, or of punishment. [This is rather harsh and unusual.]',
