    'definition': '<b>UNDISCERN\'ING</b>, <i>a.</i> Not discerning; not making just distinctions; wanting judgment or the power of discrimination.<br><br><b>UNDISCERN\'ING</b>, <i>n.</i> Want of discernment.',
