    'definition': '<b>UNINCUM\'BERED</b>, <i>a.</i><br><br>1. Not incumbered; not burdened.<br><br>2. Free from any temporary estate or interest, or from mortgage, or other charge or debt; as an estate unincumbered with dower.',
