  'Unjust': {
    'id': 57031,
    'definition': '<b>UNJUST\'</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Not just; acting contrary to the standard of right established by the divine law; not equitable; as an unjust man.<br><br>2. Contrary to justice and right; wrongful; as an unjust sentence; an unjust demand; an unjust accusation.',
