  'Unkennel': {
    'id': 57038,
    'definition': '<b>UNKEN\'NEL</b>, <i>v.t.<br><br></i> 1. To drive from his hole; as, to unkennel a fox.<br><br>2. To rouse from secrecy or retreat.<br><br>3. To release from a kennel.',
