    'definition': '<b>UNSPE\'AKABLE</b>, <i>a.</i> That cannot be uttered; that cannot be expressed; unuterable; as unspeakable grief or rage. 2 Cor 12.<br><br>Joy unspeakable and full of glory. 1 Pet 1.',
  },
  'Unspeakably': {
