    'definition': '<b>UNSTEADILY</b>, <i>adv.</i> unsted\'ily.<br><br>1. Without steadiness; in a wavering, vacillating manner.<br><br>2. Inconstantly; in a fickle manner.<br><br>3. Not in the same manner at different times; variously.',
