    'definition': '<b>UNSTEADINESS</b>, <i>n.</i> unsted\'iness.<br><br>1. Unstableness; inconstancy; want of firmness; irresolution; mutableness of opinion or purpose.<br><br>2. Frequent change of place; vacillation.',
