  'Unwind': {
    'id': 58269,
    'definition': '<b>UNWIND</b>, <i>v.t.</i> pret. and pp. unwound.<br><br>1. To wind off; to loose or separate what is wound or convolved; as, to unwind thread or a ball.<br><br>2. To disentangle.<br><br><b>UNWIND</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To admit evolution.',
