  'Unwise': {
    'id': 58271,
    'definition': '<b>UNWI\'SE</b>, <i>a.</i> s as z.<br><br>1. Not wise; not choosing the best means for the end; defective in wisdom; as an unwise man; unwise kings.<br><br>2. Not dictated by wisdom; not adapted to the end; as unwise measures.',
