  'Unwonted': {
    'id': 58288,
    'definition': '<b>UNWONTED</b>, <i>a.<br><br></i> 1. Unaccustomed; unused; not made familiar by practice; as a child unwonted to strangers; sea calves unwonted to fresh water.<br><br>2. Uncommon; unusual; infrequent; rare; as an unwonted meteor; unwonted changes.',
