  'Voyage': {
    'id': 59411,
    'definition': '<b>VOYAGE</b>, <i>n.<br><br></i> 1. A passing by sea or water from one place, port or country to another, especially a passing or journey by water to a distant place or country. Captain L. made more than a hundred voyages to the West Indies. A voyage over lake Superior is like a voyage to Bermuda.<br><br>2. The practice of traveling. [Not in use.]<br><br><b>VOYAGE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To sail or pass by water.<br><br><b>VOYAGE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To travel; to pass over.<br><br>I with pain Voyagd th unreal, vast, unbounded deep.',
