  'Vulgarity': {
    'id': 59417,
    'definition': '<b>VULGARITY</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. Mean condition in life; the state of the lower classes of society.<br><br>2. Grossness or clownishness of manners or language; as vulgarity of behavior; vulgarity of expression or language.',
