  'Wainscot': {
    'id': 59478,
    'definition': '<b>WAINSCOT</b>, <i>n.</i> In building, timber-work serving to line the walls of a room, being made in panels.<br><br><b>WAINSCOT</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To line with boards; as, to wainscot a hall.<br><br>Music sounds better in chambers wainscoted than hanged.<br><br>2. To line with different materials.<br><br>The other is wainscoted with looking-glass.',
