  'Waistcoat': {
    'id': 59485,
    'definition': '<b>WAISTCOAT</b>, <i>n.</i> [waist and coat.] A short coat or garment for men, extending no lower than the hips, and covering the waist; a vest. This under garment is now generally called in America a vest.',
