  'Waken': {
    'id': 59500,
    'definition': '<b>WAKEN</b>, <i>v.i.</i> wakn. To wake; to cease to sleep; to be awakened.<br><br>Early Turnus wakning with the light.<br><br><b>WAKEN</b>, <i>v.t.</i> wakn.<br><br>1. To excite or rouse from sleep.<br><br>Go, waken Eve.<br><br>2. To excite to action or motion.<br><br>Then Homers and Tyraeus martial muse wakend the world.<br><br>3. To excite; to produce; to rouse into action.<br><br>They introduce their sacred song, and waken raptures high.',
