  'Walker': {
    'id': 59511,
    'definition': '<b>WALKER</b>, <i>n.</i> Wauker.<br><br>1. One who walks.<br><br>2. In our mother tongue, a fuller.<br><br>3. In law, a forest officer appointed to walk over a certain space for inspection; a forester.<br><br>4. One who deports himself in a particular manner.<br><br>5. A fulling-mill. [Not in use or local.]',
