  'Walking': {
    'id': 59512,
    'definition': '<b>WALKING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Wauking. Moving on the legs with a slow pace; moving; conducting ones self.<br><br><b>WALKING</b>, <i>n.</i> Wauking. The act of moving on the feet with a slow pace.',
