  'Wall-Wort': {
    'id': 59530,
    'definition': '<b>WALL-WORT</b>, <i>n.</i> A plant, the dwarf elder or danewort; a species of Sambucus.<br><br><b>WALL</b>, <i>v.t.</i><br><br>1. To inclose with a wall; as, to wall a city.<br><br>2 To defend by walls.<br><br>And terror of his name that walls us in from danger.<br><br>3. To fill up with a wall.',
