  'Warfare': {
    'id': 59612,
    'definition': '<b>WARFARE</b>, <i>n.</i> [war and fare.]<br><br>1. Military service; military life; war.<br><br>The Philistines gathered their armies for warfare. 1 Sam 28.<br><br>2. Contest; struggle with spiritual enemies.<br><br>The weapons of our warfare are not carnal. 2 Cor 10.<br><br><b>WARFARE</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To lead a military life; to carry on continual wars.<br><br>In that credulous warfaring age. [Little used.]',
