  'Wariness': {
    'id': 59617,
    'definition': '<b>WARINESS</b>, <i>n.</i> Caution; prudent care to foresee and guard against evil. The road was so slippery, and the danger so great, that we were obliged to proceed with wariness.<br><br>To determine what are little things in religion, great wariness is to be used.',
