  'Warren': {
    'id': 59661,
    'definition': '<b>WARREN</b>, <i>n.</i> [See <a href="dict://Guard,">Guard,</a> Warrant and Wary.]<br><br>1. A piece of ground appropriated to the breeding and preservation of rabbits.<br><br>2. In law, a franchise or place privileged by prescription or grant from the king, for keeping beasts and fowls. The warren is the next franchise in degree to the park; and a forest, which is the highest in dignity, comprehends a chase, a park and a free warren.<br><br>3. A place for keeping fish in a river.',
