  'Wart': {
    'id': 59666,
    'definition': '<b>WART</b>, <i>n.</i> Waurt. [G.]<br><br>1. A hard excrescence on the skin of animals, which is covered with the production of the cuticle. In horses, warts are spungy excrescences on the hinder pasterns, which suppurate.<br><br>2. A protuberance on trees.',
