  'Wartwort': {
    'id': 59668,
    'definition': '<b>WARTWORT</b>, <i>n.</i> A plant of the genus Euphorbia or spurge, which is studded with hard warty knobs; also, a plant of the genus Heliotropium, and another of the genus Lapsana.',
