    'definition': '<b>WASHING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Cleansing with water; purifying; overflowing; overspreading.<br><br><b>WASHING</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. The act of cleansing with water; ablution. Heb 9.<br><br>2. A wash; or the clothes washed.',
