  'Washy': {
    'id': 59681,
    'definition': '<b>WASHY</b>, <i>a.</i> [from wash.]<br><br>1. Watery; damp; soft; as the washy ooze.<br><br>2. Weak; not solid.<br><br>3. Weak; not firm or hardy; liable to sweat profusely with labor; as a washy horse. [New England.]',
