  'Wassail': {
    'id': 59687,
    'definition': '<b>WASSAIL</b>, <i>n.</i><br><br>1. A liquor made of apples, sugar and ale, formerly much used by English good fellows.<br><br>2. A drunken bout.<br><br>3. A merry song. [This word in unknown in America.]<br><br><b>WASSAIL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To hold a merry drinking meeting.',
