  'Wasting': {
    'id': 59703,
    'definition': '<b>WASTING</b>, <i>ppr.</i><br><br>1. Lavishing prodigally; expending or consuming without use; diminishing by slow dissipation; desolating; laying waste.<br><br>Wasting and relentless war has made ravages, with but few and short intermissions, from the days of the tyrant Nimrod down to the Nimrod of our own age.<br><br>2. a. Diminishing by dissipation or by great destruction; as a wasting disease.',
