  'Water-Furrow': {
    'id': 59742,
    'definition': '<b>WATER-FURROW</b>, <i>n.</i> [water and furrow.] In agriculture, a deep furrow made for conducting water fro the ground and keeping it dry.<br><br><b>WATER-FURROW</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To plow or open water furrows.',
