  'Waxing': {
    'id': 59841,
    'definition': '<b>WAXING</b>, <i>ppr.</i> Growing; increasing; becoming; smearing with wax.<br><br><b>WAXING</b>, <i>n.</i> In chemistry, the preparation of any matter to render it fit for melting; also, the process of stopping out colors in calico-printing.',
