  'Weeding-Rhim': {
    'id': 59958,
    'definition': '<b>WEEDING-RHIM</b>, <i>n.</i> An implement somewhat like the frame of a wheel-barrow, used for tearing up weeds on summer fallows, &c.; used in Kent, England.',
