  'Well-Done': {
    'id': 60019,
    'definition': '<b>WELL-DONE</b>, <i>exclam.</i> [well and done.] A word of praise; bravely; nobly; in a right manner.',
  },
  'Well-Drain': {
    'id': 60020,
    'definition': '<b>WELL-DRAIN</b>, <i>n.</i> [well and drain.] A drain or vent for water, somewhat like a well or pit, serving to discharge the water of wet land.<br><br><b>WELL-DRAIN</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To drain land by means of wells or pits, which receive the water, and from which it is discharged by machinery.',
