  },
  'Willow': {
    'id': 60430,
    'definition': '<b>WILLOW</b>, <i>n.</i> [L.] A tree of the genus Salix. There are several species of willow, the white, the black, the purple or red, the sallow, and the broad leaved willow, &c. A species called the weeping willow, has long and slender branches which droop and hang downward, the Salix Babylonica.',
  },
