    'definition': '<b>WINTER-KILL</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [winter and kill.] To kill by means of the weather in winter; as, to winter-kill wheat or clover.<br><br><b>WINTER-KILL</b>, <i>v.i.</i> To be killed by the winter. Wheat is liable to winter-kill in moist land.',
