    'definition': '<b>WINTER-LODGE, WINTER-LODGMENT</b>, <i>n.</i> [winter and lodge.] In botany, the hybernacle of a plant, which protects the embryo or future shoot from injuries during the winter. It is either a bud or a bulb.',
