  'Wire': {
    'id': 60551,
    'definition': '<b>WIRE</b>, <i>n.</i> A thread of metal; any metallic substance drawn to an even thread.<br><br><b>WIRE</b>, <i>v.t.</i> To bind with wire; to apply wire to, as in bottling liquors.',
