  'Wiredraw': {
    'id': 60555,
    'definition': '<b>WIREDRAW</b>, <i>v.t.</i> [wire and draw.]<br><br>1. To draw a metal into wire, which is done by drawing it through a hole in a plate of steel.<br><br>2. To draw into length.<br><br>3. To draw by art or violence.<br><br>My sense has been wiredrawn into blasphemy.<br><br>4. To draw or spin out to great length and tenuity; as, to wiredraw an argument.',
