  'Witch-Hazel': {
    'id': 60590,
    'definition': '<br>WITCH-HAZEL, n.<br><br>1. A species of elm, (Ulmus montana.)<br><br>2. The hop-hornbeam, (carpinus ostrya.)<br><br>The Virginian witch-hazel is the Hamemelis virginica, a shrub which flowers in autumn when its leaves are falling.',
