  'Witchcraft': {
    'id': 60591,
    'definition': '<b>WITCHCRAFT</b>, <i>[witch</i> and craft.]<br><br>1. The practices of witches; sorcery; enchantments; intercourse with the devil.<br><br>2. Power more than natural.<br><br>He hath a witchcraft over the king ins tongue.',
