  'Witty': {
    'id': 60641,
    'definition': '<b>WITTY</b>, <i>a.</i> [from wit.]<br><br>1. Possessed of wit; full of wit; as a witty poet.<br><br>2. Judicious; ingenious; inventive.<br><br>3. Sarcastic; full of taunts.<br><br>Honeycomb was unmercifully witty upon the women.',
