  'Wrass': {
    'id': 60881,
    'definition': '<b>WRASS, WRASSE</b>, <i>n.</i> A fish, the Labrus tinca of Linne, called by authors, turdus vulgaris, or tinca marina, the sea-tench, and sometimes old-wife. It resembles the carp in figure, and is covered with large scales. The name is also applied to other species of the genus Labrus.',
